(1377267, 175189, 28882, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, the cropping is great, and I like the depth of field effect.   the triangle I assume is the leaf.  It could be a little clearer.</td>', 'I love the colors, the cropping is great, and I like the depth of field effect.   the triangle I assume is the leaf.  It could be a little clearer.', '2005-05-11 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
