(1377289, 176423, 34306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and really creative for the challenge. The one thing that bothers me a tiny bit is that the depth of field is just a tad too small - somehow I feel the needle in the back is just a little too much out of focus. Still, a really great shot, with very nice colors also.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and really creative for the challenge. The one thing that bothers me a tiny bit is that the depth of field is just a tad too small - somehow I feel the needle in the back is just a little too much out of focus. Still, a really great shot, with very nice colors also.', '2005-05-11 03:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
