(1377291, 176505, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  A little sharper in the triangles and less of the rest of the building would of helped.  There is some jaggedness in the water to the right and to much punch to the whites. 7</td>', 'Nice photo.  A little sharper in the triangles and less of the rest of the building would of helped.  There is some jaggedness in the water to the right and to much punch to the whites. 7', '2005-05-11 03:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
