(1377763, 176352, 29797, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nice composition and contrast in this shot. The frame works nicely. I would use a little bit of (dare I say it?) NeatImage to remove some of the ISO noise. I got hammered by a few here the one time I used NI (Ansel Adams) for loss of detail, but you shouldn''t lose much detail in this shot with it.</td>', 'I like this. Nice composition and contrast in this shot. The frame works nicely. I would use a little bit of (dare I say it?) NeatImage to remove some of the ISO noise. I got hammered by a few here the one time I used NI (Ansel Adams) for loss of detail, but you shouldn''t lose much detail in this shot with it.', '2005-05-11 10:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
