(1378065, 176594, 26475, '<td valign="top">I''d be interested to know the reason you named it "Daniel". I know the meaning of the name Daniel is "God is my Judge", but I don''t see the relevence here, other then to embarass myself with mentioning the Stargate reference with the Pyramid, and thinking I really am a Sci-Fi junkie...LOL I would have liked to see the cloth in front completely blacked out. I think it would make a stronger image to have the object floating in space, so as not to detract from the image.</td>', 'I''d be interested to know the reason you named it "Daniel". I know the meaning of the name Daniel is "God is my Judge", but I don''t see the relevence here, other then to embarass myself with mentioning the Stargate reference with the Pyramid, and thinking I really am a Sci-Fi junkie...LOL I would have liked to see the cloth in front completely blacked out. I think it would make a stronger image to have the object floating in space, so as not to detract from the image.', '2005-05-11 11:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378067, 176120, 34659, '<td valign="top">ROFL - VERY funny title!  Nice job.  I love the idea and the shapes are great (by the way, I''m tubby there in the back!), but the white background (especially against the yellow) is a little overpowering - making it too bright (maybe lighting source/s were issue too).  Otherwise, i would have scored it higher.  (6)</td>', 'ROFL - VERY funny title!  Nice job.  I love the idea and the shapes are great (by the way, I''m tubby there in the back!), but the white background (especially against the yellow) is a little overpowering - making it too bright (maybe lighting source/s were issue too).  Otherwise, i would have scored it higher.  (6)', '2005-05-11 11:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
