(1378124, 175486, 19746, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, but it''s a pity about the background.  I like this B/W Style, but perhaps would have gone with a shallower DOF to try and obscure the background a little more, perhaps at the partial expense of some of the subject.  Cool shot nonetheless, and I''m going to vote 6, would be more if there weren''t those things in the BG.  Where was this taken?  Looks like a Telkom (South Africa) phone booth in the background.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge, particularly if you''re a South African ;)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I love the subject, but it''s a pity about the background.  I like this B/W Style, but perhaps would have gone with a shallower DOF to try and obscure the background a little more, perhaps at the partial expense of some of the subject.  Cool shot nonetheless, and I''m going to vote 6, would be more if there weren''t those things in the BG.  Where was this taken?  Looks like a Telkom (South Africa) phone booth in the background. Good luck with the challenge, particularly if you''re a South African ;) Alex', '2005-05-11 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378125, 174916, 26475, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this in a different challenge. The sapes and contrast are wonderful, however it''s a struggle to find the triangle. I know you were seeing it in the shadow, but this photo has the distinction of being a square peg in a round hole.  The photo however stands on it''s own, with sharpness and contrast and being off kilter enough so that it makes it akin to an abstract painting. As I said, I just wish it were in a different challenge so I couls score it higher -6</td>', 'I would have liked to see this in a different challenge. The sapes and contrast are wonderful, however it''s a struggle to find the triangle. I know you were seeing it in the shadow, but this photo has the distinction of being a square peg in a round hole.  The photo however stands on it''s own, with sharpness and contrast and being off kilter enough so that it makes it akin to an abstract painting. As I said, I just wish it were in a different challenge so I couls score it higher -6', '2005-05-11 11:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
