(1378141, 176567, 19746, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and was thinking about doing something similar initially before deciding on my final subject.  I think this shot is cool, except it is a little blurry and I''m not overly enamoured with the lighting.  There is also a distracting strip of something in the bottom right.  I imagine it would have been difficult to do this.  Points for the idea and the effort!  A 6 from me.<br/> <br/>Good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I like this idea, and was thinking about doing something similar initially before deciding on my final subject.  I think this shot is cool, except it is a little blurry and I''m not overly enamoured with the lighting.  There is also a distracting strip of something in the bottom right.  I imagine it would have been difficult to do this.  Points for the idea and the effort!  A 6 from me. Good luck! Alex', '2005-05-11 11:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
