(1378151, 176426, 26475, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, and being the point of the challenge and I''m looking for it, I see the triangle...but If I were looking at this shot without knowing the intent, then I wouldn''t immediately think "triangle"...and that''s what I''m looking to see in this challenge. It''s not enough that you can force the triangle into the photo...Maybe I''m not abstract enough of a person, but upon initial inspection, I see a line. Not a triangle. And I think this might suffer for the fact that a lot of people will give no more then a passing glance, and they won''t see it. Most people will need to be hit over the head with the actual replica of the shape, other then a loose representation of it. That being said, because the more I look at it, the more I like it, I''m giving you a 6. LOL.</td>', 'This is a good photo, and being the point of the challenge and I''m looking for it, I see the triangle...but If I were looking at this shot without knowing the intent, then I wouldn''t immediately think "triangle"...and that''s what I''m looking to see in this challenge. It''s not enough that you can force the triangle into the photo...Maybe I''m not abstract enough of a person, but upon initial inspection, I see a line. Not a triangle. And I think this might suffer for the fact that a lot of people will give no more then a passing glance, and they won''t see it. Most people will need to be hit over the head with the actual replica of the shape, other then a loose representation of it. That being said, because the more I look at it, the more I like it, I''m giving you a 6. LOL.', '2005-05-11 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
