(1378226, 176352, 19746, '<td valign="top">This is a highly creative and original take on the triangle challenge.  I love this shot but I fear it won''t do well for a couple of reasons...<br/> <br/>1)  It''s dangerously creative and abstract for DPC ;) <br/> <br/>2)  Some peoples monitors may be badly calibrated.  I actually saw this shot earlier today on a friends PC and wasn''t that impressed, but upon arriving home on my <br/> <br/>What you''ve done here is really fantastic.  The triangle in top left, middle and bottom right, as well as the triangle made by the right hand building.  If I wanted to be picky I''d say you could have composed it so that you''d still get all the triangles but the lines would all find corners and everything would be triangled away (that''s a pun, and it''s a torrid one at that).  <br/> <br/>I love this shot, and it''ll be the highest rating I''ve given anything in this challenge by 2...a 10.<br/></td>', 'This is a highly creative and original take on the triangle challenge.  I love this shot but I fear it won''t do well for a couple of reasons... 1)  It''s dangerously creative and abstract for DPC ;)  2)  Some peoples monitors may be badly calibrated.  I actually saw this shot earlier today on a friends PC and wasn''t that impressed, but upon arriving home on my  What you''ve done here is really fantastic.  The triangle in top left, middle and bottom right, as well as the triangle made by the right hand building.  If I wanted to be picky I''d say you could have composed it so that you''d still get all the triangles but the lines would all find corners and everything would be triangled away (that''s a pun, and it''s a torrid one at that).   I love this shot, and it''ll be the highest rating I''ve given anything in this challenge by 2...a 10.', '2005-05-11 12:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
