(1378278, 174965, 19746, '<td valign="top">Looks more dangerous than anything else!  I''ve seen quite a cool picture of guys trying to clean the windows on that thing.  Architecture gone wild! I''d prefer to see the building standalone than framed by the plants.  Also, the image just seems a little washed out.  Perhaps the wrong time of the day?  I would have rather taken this +-2 Hours after sunrise or +-2 hours before sunset, most outdoor photos in fact.  Good luck with this intersting subject! (5)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Looks more dangerous than anything else!  I''ve seen quite a cool picture of guys trying to clean the windows on that thing.  Architecture gone wild! I''d prefer to see the building standalone than framed by the plants.  Also, the image just seems a little washed out.  Perhaps the wrong time of the day?  I would have rather taken this +-2 Hours after sunrise or +-2 hours before sunset, most outdoor photos in fact.  Good luck with this intersting subject! (5) Alex', '2005-05-11 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
