(1378315, 176444, 36299, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette, lighting a little higher up, move the earth please for the sun is to heavy...., also would help with overpowered light in the middle, 8.</td>', 'Great silhouette, lighting a little higher up, move the earth please for the sun is to heavy...., also would help with overpowered light in the middle, 8.', '2005-05-11 12:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378318, 176426, 37659, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the triangle portrayed by the fade into the horizon - clever. Unfortunately, I think the rest of the photo, the background, subtracts from it, it''s too conspicuous and draws attention away from the main subject, I think... Perhaps a crop down to the road would be better?</td>', 'I like the idea, the triangle portrayed by the fade into the horizon - clever. Unfortunately, I think the rest of the photo, the background, subtracts from it, it''s too conspicuous and draws attention away from the main subject, I think... Perhaps a crop down to the road would be better?', '2005-05-11 12:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378319, 175884, 36299, '<td valign="top">Church steeples.  I like the idea, it seems a tad soft, would be nice if it was sharper. 9</td>', 'Church steeples.  I like the idea, it seems a tad soft, would be nice if it was sharper. 9', '2005-05-11 12:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378320, 175122, 34134, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better from a different angle. The trees in the background make the composition too busy. Maybe shooting lower with the sky behind. Good luck.</td>', 'I think this would be better from a different angle. The trees in the background make the composition too busy. Maybe shooting lower with the sky behind. Good luck.', '2005-05-11 12:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
