(1378328, 175497, 3419, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool concept, but if you were trying for the "alien invasion", this just simply looks like a triangle hanging in front of a photo. So.... it doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'It''s a cool concept, but if you were trying for the "alien invasion", this just simply looks like a triangle hanging in front of a photo. So.... it doesn''t really work for me.', '2005-05-11 12:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
