(1378337, 176406, 37659, '<td valign="top">Love these colours and textures!</td>', 'Love these colours and textures!', '2005-05-11 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378338, 175404, 19746, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool idea, I like that.  Reductionist subject but striking enough to fit the challenge.  You''ve also created a composiitional triangle with the eyes-tip of nose, bridge of nose.  I like this shot and I''m giving it an 8.  Congratulations on a good effort, technically sound, fits the challenge and you''ve been quite creative in choosing your subject.  Good job and best of luck for this challenge!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'That''s a cool idea, I like that.  Reductionist subject but striking enough to fit the challenge.  You''ve also created a composiitional triangle with the eyes-tip of nose, bridge of nose.  I like this shot and I''m giving it an 8.  Congratulations on a good effort, technically sound, fits the challenge and you''ve been quite creative in choosing your subject.  Good job and best of luck for this challenge! Alex', '2005-05-11 12:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378340, 174825, 34659, '<td valign="top">Shot is out of focus, but I like the colors &amp; concept.  Seems like the camera (for whatever reason) picked up on the wood background to focus on - rather than the pyramid.  Depending on your settings, you were probably too close to the subject, so the camera defaulted to its minimum distance at that setting - the wood background.  It was a very unique idea and there''s nice composition, but the blurriness of the image detracts from the shot. (3)</td>', 'Shot is out of focus, but I like the colors & concept.  Seems like the camera (for whatever reason) picked up on the wood background to focus on - rather than the pyramid.  Depending on your settings, you were probably too close to the subject, so the camera defaulted to its minimum distance at that setting - the wood background.  It was a very unique idea and there''s nice composition, but the blurriness of the image detracts from the shot. (3)', '2005-05-11 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378342, 175103, 37659, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2005-05-11 12:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
