(1378398, 175189, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro - good exposure and great detail. I like how the triangle leaf provides balance for the photo.</td>', 'Very nice macro - good exposure and great detail. I like how the triangle leaf provides balance for the photo.', '2005-05-11 12:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
