(1378405, 175182, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The woodpecker gets a little lost in the muted browns &amp; greens of the ground, but it''s nicely composed.  In my VERY humble opinion, the colors are overall a little drab - you could probably bring out more of the green to make the bird &amp; red triangle stand out even more.  (I love birds!)  Nice job!  (6)</td>', 'Great shot!  The woodpecker gets a little lost in the muted browns & greens of the ground, but it''s nicely composed.  In my VERY humble opinion, the colors are overall a little drab - you could probably bring out more of the green to make the bird & red triangle stand out even more.  (I love birds!)  Nice job!  (6)', '2005-05-11 12:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378406, 175110, 19746, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best.  A fantastic and dramatic interpretation of the challenge, I like this a lot.  Great shot and you''ve composed it perfectly.  A 9 from me...<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Simplicity at its best.  A fantastic and dramatic interpretation of the challenge, I like this a lot.  Great shot and you''ve composed it perfectly.  A 9 from me... Alex', '2005-05-11 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
