(1378662, 176523, 34633, '<td valign="top">it''s a very nice shot photographically. It doesn''t really hit me with the term "triangle" when I first looked at it though, I am looking for something more intuitive for maximum score. I see your triangles in this shot, too, though.</td>', 'it''s a very nice shot photographically. It doesn''t really hit me with the term "triangle" when I first looked at it though, I am looking for something more intuitive for maximum score. I see your triangles in this shot, too, though.', '2005-05-11 14:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
