(1378685, 176519, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . . . that is such an awesome picture!    I love everything about it.   Your composition,  the tones, the fact that it''s an adorable baby with the cutest expression on its  face ever!    It''s just an amazing photo!   Good luck!</td>', 'Awwwww. . . . that is such an awesome picture!    I love everything about it.   Your composition,  the tones, the fact that it''s an adorable baby with the cutest expression on its  face ever!    It''s just an amazing photo!   Good luck!', '2005-05-11 14:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
