(1378688, 175992, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and fits the challenge, but it''s a very static presentation. Aside from the color (which looks a little over-saturated), nothing really grabs my interest about this one.</td>', 'Very colorful and fits the challenge, but it''s a very static presentation. Aside from the color (which looks a little over-saturated), nothing really grabs my interest about this one.', '2005-05-11 14:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
