(1378702, 176498, 34633, '<td valign="top">great idea and subject. The focus is a little soft though: ways to change that include<br/>1) use of USM before submitting<br/>2) use of higher aperature while shooting<br/>--&gt; if possible, get the shot on a sunny day, it''ll give you more light, a smaller aperature, and more interesting contrasts of the topography of the flower<br/>3) did you use a tripod?</td>', 'great idea and subject. The focus is a little soft though: ways to change that include1) use of USM before submitting2) use of higher aperature while shooting--> if possible, get the shot on a sunny day, it''ll give you more light, a smaller aperature, and more interesting contrasts of the topography of the flower3) did you use a tripod?', '2005-05-11 14:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378703, 176435, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse!!!!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful horse!!!!!!!', '2005-05-11 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
