(1379401, 176068, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good job on seeing the triangles.  Good diagonal position of the stalk too.  I would, however, not place the head so much in the center as it makes the photograph static visually especially that you had the stalk in diagonal position.  A suggestion is  to have another ball in soft focus (use shallow DOF) "echoing" in the background to make it more visually stimulating.</td>', 'Good job on seeing the triangles.  Good diagonal position of the stalk too.  I would, however, not place the head so much in the center as it makes the photograph static visually especially that you had the stalk in diagonal position.  A suggestion is  to have another ball in soft focus (use shallow DOF) "echoing" in the background to make it more visually stimulating.', '2005-05-11 17:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
