(1379497, 176723, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very inventive and excellent take on the challenge.  I can tell you though, in my humble opinion, the focus should have been more on the triangles than the sky.  While the barn has such a attention-getting color, the vastness of the sky negates the focus on it that your reader''s eyes get confused.  Try cropping about half an inch to an inch above the tree line and see now that your reader''s interest is all on the triangles and probably will give you a higher score.</td>', 'Very inventive and excellent take on the challenge.  I can tell you though, in my humble opinion, the focus should have been more on the triangles than the sky.  While the barn has such a attention-getting color, the vastness of the sky negates the focus on it that your reader''s eyes get confused.  Try cropping about half an inch to an inch above the tree line and see now that your reader''s interest is all on the triangles and probably will give you a higher score.', '2005-05-11 18:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379499, 175669, 33352, '<td valign="top">The jury is still out.....7</td>', 'The jury is still out.....7', '2005-05-11 18:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379500, 176605, 34759, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower.. I''m not crazy about the border though. It draws attention away from the subject in my opinion.</td>', 'Pretty flower.. I''m not crazy about the border though. It draws attention away from the subject in my opinion.', '2005-05-11 18:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379501, 176248, 33352, '<td valign="top">ok........8</td>', 'ok........8', '2005-05-11 18:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379508, 176215, 12962, '<td valign="top">Muy excelente!  Nature''s graphical design at its best and very well seen by you and your camera (and it probably even looks better in your computer too).</td>', 'Muy excelente!  Nature''s graphical design at its best and very well seen by you and your camera (and it probably even looks better in your computer too).', '2005-05-11 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
