(1379531, 176363, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful advertising piece, could have worked in the jewelry challenge too.  I love the isolation from the background and the lighting.  If you could just have turned the top 180 degrees so the name could be read normally :-) ...</td>', 'Beautiful advertising piece, could have worked in the jewelry challenge too.  I love the isolation from the background and the lighting.  If you could just have turned the top 180 degrees so the name could be read normally :-) ...', '2005-05-11 18:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
