(1379540, 176730, 24991, '<td valign="top">Does she really have to be topless?  I really don''t feel that she did in order to make this shot work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by Konador - Removed Sentence.</i></td>', 'Does she really have to be topless?  I really don''t feel that she did in order to make this shot work.Message edited by Konador - Removed Sentence.', '2005-05-11 18:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379543, 176505, 12962, '<td valign="top">Color''s great.  Background elements are a little bit distracting, even if they''re minor part of the photograph.  The light and the person on the right especially pull my eyes toward them - they shouldn''t because the triangular monument deserves the attention.  A simple crop would have eliminated this distraction.</td>', 'Color''s great.  Background elements are a little bit distracting, even if they''re minor part of the photograph.  The light and the person on the right especially pull my eyes toward them - they shouldn''t because the triangular monument deserves the attention.  A simple crop would have eliminated this distraction.', '2005-05-11 18:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379545, 176556, 24454, '<td valign="top">How interesting!!!    What a perspective!</td>', 'How interesting!!!    What a perspective!', '2005-05-11 18:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
