(1379633, 176459, 32672, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a different crop would make it stronger, but the crop you chose is certianly more interesting than if you  had included the whole sign in the frame, as most wouldn''t think to do otherwise.</td>', 'Perhaps a different crop would make it stronger, but the crop you chose is certianly more interesting than if you  had included the whole sign in the frame, as most wouldn''t think to do otherwise.', '2005-05-11 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379634, 174938, 12962, '<td valign="top">Colors are great, good interpretation of the challenge, good isolation of the subject (good choice of dof), but most of all, I like that you thought outside the box which is not so common in dpc.  Good job!</td>', 'Colors are great, good interpretation of the challenge, good isolation of the subject (good choice of dof), but most of all, I like that you thought outside the box which is not so common in dpc.  Good job!', '2005-05-11 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
