(1379656, 174516, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture.   It looks like a painting.   I love the color tones, and I like the composition -- the fact that you can see more than just the triangular roof.   10</td>', 'Awesome picture.   It looks like a painting.   I love the color tones, and I like the composition -- the fact that you can see more than just the triangular roof.   10', '2005-05-11 19:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
