(1379661, 176457, 12962, '<td valign="top">I love the scruffy, dirty, rugged modeling you have here.  The subtle reflection is also a good effect.  Black and white certainly fits too.</td>', 'I love the scruffy, dirty, rugged modeling you have here.  The subtle reflection is also a good effect.  Black and white certainly fits too.', '2005-05-11 19:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
