(1379670, 176258, 12962, '<td valign="top">Makes me hungry.  I would have popped up the colors more and remove the gray cast in levels, curves or shadows/highlights.  I love that a piece was bitten off ... it makes it more dynamic.</td>', 'Makes me hungry.  I would have popped up the colors more and remove the gray cast in levels, curves or shadows/highlights.  I love that a piece was bitten off ... it makes it more dynamic.', '2005-05-11 19:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
