(1379691, 175474, 36583, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... Great idea to meet the challenge. I wish some of the extra branches from other trees were not there, but still very nice.</td>', 'Very nice shot... Great idea to meet the challenge. I wish some of the extra branches from other trees were not there, but still very nice.', '2005-05-11 19:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379692, 176148, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like how the road disappears ... lots of details are lost in the grass and leaves though.  Needs a little bit more saturation (just a simple level adjustment) to remove that grayish cast.  If you do that, your greens and the red will pop up and you have a wonderful summer photograph.</td>', 'I like how the road disappears ... lots of details are lost in the grass and leaves though.  Needs a little bit more saturation (just a simple level adjustment) to remove that grayish cast.  If you do that, your greens and the red will pop up and you have a wonderful summer photograph.', '2005-05-11 19:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379696, 176426, 36583, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... Nice idea... Grainy sky, but you may have been trying for that... More contrast? Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot... Nice idea... Grainy sky, but you may have been trying for that... More contrast? Good job.', '2005-05-11 19:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379697, 176396, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good macro.  The compression artefacts (grains) are visible in the dark purple areas though.  Too bad because this is just lovely especially if you place your main element off center.</td>', 'Good macro.  The compression artefacts (grains) are visible in the dark purple areas though.  Too bad because this is just lovely especially if you place your main element off center.', '2005-05-11 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
