(1379705, 176006, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Good job in capturing this.  The lines and patterns are incredible.  What distracts though is the blown out appearance of the middle third that hides the detail of the walls.  This can easily be corrected in post processing by increasing the highlights either in levels, curves or highlights or combination ... if you do that, the patterns on the walls just bloom and would make this picture rated higher.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Good job in capturing this.  The lines and patterns are incredible.  What distracts though is the blown out appearance of the middle third that hides the detail of the walls.  This can easily be corrected in post processing by increasing the highlights either in levels, curves or highlights or combination ... if you do that, the patterns on the walls just bloom and would make this picture rated higher.', '2005-05-11 19:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
