(1379780, 175170, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you used a tripod, but this doesn''t seem in focus..pretty blurry. The shutter will stay open longer for dark shots, so hand held really won''t work. Love the colors and great looking bridge.</td>', 'Not sure if you used a tripod, but this doesn''t seem in focus..pretty blurry. The shutter will stay open longer for dark shots, so hand held really won''t work. Love the colors and great looking bridge.', '2005-05-11 20:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379785, 174078, 35645, '<td valign="top">Suject is tilted - can''t tell if it''s intentional or not, but I don''t particularly like it. You''ve also got some rough edges where the red contrasts against the blue (I know there''s a term for it, but I can''t think of it). I like the colors and perspective, though, and I think that with a couple of tweaks this could be a really good photo.</td>', 'Suject is tilted - can''t tell if it''s intentional or not, but I don''t particularly like it. You''ve also got some rough edges where the red contrasts against the blue (I know there''s a term for it, but I can''t think of it). I like the colors and perspective, though, and I think that with a couple of tweaks this could be a really good photo.', '2005-05-11 20:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
