(1379795, 175363, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Love the color. If there had been a hair more light on the face, I''d have given it a 10. As it stands, it''s a 9.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Love the color. If there had been a hair more light on the face, I''d have given it a 10. As it stands, it''s a 9.', '2005-05-11 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
