(1379809, 176572, 22340, '<td valign="top">nice exposure/focus execution and color ... kids always help .. one of my top 10</td>', 'nice exposure/focus execution and color ... kids always help .. one of my top 10', '2005-05-11 20:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379814, 175824, 12962, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of beautiful things going for this photograph - the idyllic setting, the blue water, the quaint watercraft (is that a banca?)  in the foreground balanced by the people in the background.  But there''s also a lot going against it - the whites are washed out that you lose a lot of details especially the texture of the white sand, the horizon is slightly tilted,  the colors are a little bit muted (at least in my monitor), and, yes, the triangle is not well defined.  A punch in the color by a small adjustment in levels will do wonders for this photograph.</td>', 'There''s a lot of beautiful things going for this photograph - the idyllic setting, the blue water, the quaint watercraft (is that a banca?)  in the foreground balanced by the people in the background.  But there''s also a lot going against it - the whites are washed out that you lose a lot of details especially the texture of the white sand, the horizon is slightly tilted,  the colors are a little bit muted (at least in my monitor), and, yes, the triangle is not well defined.  A punch in the color by a small adjustment in levels will do wonders for this photograph.', '2005-05-11 20:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379816, 175814, 12962, '<td valign="top">Well seen.</td>', 'Well seen.', '2005-05-11 20:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379818, 174938, 22340, '<td valign="top">certainly most excellent exposure, focus and color ... great use of DOF for isolation and the creative clustered triangle completes a possible ribbon winner</td>', 'certainly most excellent exposure, focus and color ... great use of DOF for isolation and the creative clustered triangle completes a possible ribbon winner', '2005-05-11 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379819, 176500, 22379, '<td valign="top">your riangles look kinda square to me...</td>', 'your riangles look kinda square to me...', '2005-05-11 20:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379825, 175878, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ''country'' detail.  Too bad the lighting is harsh.  If you''ve waited for the sun to come down and then take your picture, this would have been more than excellent.  Either that or move around with your camera and take the shot at an angle but not losing the triangles.</td>', 'Beautiful ''country'' detail.  Too bad the lighting is harsh.  If you''ve waited for the sun to come down and then take your picture, this would have been more than excellent.  Either that or move around with your camera and take the shot at an angle but not losing the triangles.', '2005-05-11 20:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379827, 174901, 12962, '<td valign="top">Dizzying.  Beautiful blue.  Motion suggested is great.</td>', 'Dizzying.  Beautiful blue.  Motion suggested is great.', '2005-05-11 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379831, 175699, 12962, '<td valign="top">One of the better ones in this challenge.  10.</td>', 'One of the better ones in this challenge.  10.', '2005-05-11 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379838, 175611, 12962, '<td valign="top">The repeating reflection gives this a very nice graphical pattern.  Complimentary colors are great.  Would have been great if the horizontal is level and the focus spot on.</td>', 'The repeating reflection gives this a very nice graphical pattern.  Complimentary colors are great.  Would have been great if the horizontal is level and the focus spot on.', '2005-05-11 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
