(1379851, 176220, 22340, '<td valign="top">this is really nice with creative use of triangle, good isolation via DOF, and certainaly appealing colors ... only minor con is the difficult white/black contrasts of the bird''s head .. nevertheless a top entry 10 IMO</td>', 'this is really nice with creative use of triangle, good isolation via DOF, and certainaly appealing colors ... only minor con is the difficult white/black contrasts of the bird''s head .. nevertheless a top entry 10 IMO', '2005-05-11 20:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
