(1379891, 174742, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice echoing at the back.  Would probably be better if you ''go in'' some more and you positioned yourself more to the right.  But you achieved a good separation between the roses and that looks good.  I feel bad because the color of this probably looks better in your computer - the orange and yellows are so lush when I downloaded this and opened it in Photoshop.</td>', 'Nice echoing at the back.  Would probably be better if you ''go in'' some more and you positioned yourself more to the right.  But you achieved a good separation between the roses and that looks good.  I feel bad because the color of this probably looks better in your computer - the orange and yellows are so lush when I downloaded this and opened it in Photoshop.', '2005-05-11 20:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
