(1380357, 176590, 26475, '<td valign="top">I see the triangles, but I''d be hard pressed to say that it''s the emphasis of the photo. It''s more incidental. If you zoomed in, or took the shot from a different perspective, it would work better for me. As it stands now, and with the trees behind the bridge, the framework blends into the landscape, removing the subject (the triangles) from the scene all together.</td>', 'I see the triangles, but I''d be hard pressed to say that it''s the emphasis of the photo. It''s more incidental. If you zoomed in, or took the shot from a different perspective, it would work better for me. As it stands now, and with the trees behind the bridge, the framework blends into the landscape, removing the subject (the triangles) from the scene all together.', '2005-05-12 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
