(1381233, 175582, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love windmills.   I''ve never seen one like that.   I like this picture a lot.   Good luck.</td>', 'I love windmills.   I''ve never seen one like that.   I like this picture a lot.   Good luck.', '2005-05-12 13:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381235, 174901, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective!   I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very cool perspective!   I like it a lot.', '2005-05-12 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381237, 176611, 25655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place.<br/>I really like the triangles of the trees and I am not sure I need the fence in the photo, but still it''s beautiful and so peaceful. 8</td>', 'Beautiful place.I really like the triangles of the trees and I am not sure I need the fence in the photo, but still it''s beautiful and so peaceful. 8', '2005-05-12 13:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381239, 175103, 25655, '<td valign="top">Funny an beautifuly detailed.<br/>I just love the DOF here, and the rich colors.<br/>So far the best I''ve seen in this chalenge! 10</td>', 'Funny an beautifuly detailed.I just love the DOF here, and the rich colors.So far the best I''ve seen in this chalenge! 10', '2005-05-12 13:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381243, 176457, 25655, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I like the b&amp;w here, the reflections and the texture of those hands. <br/>Wonderful photo. 9</td>', 'Great lighting, I like the b&w here, the reflections and the texture of those hands. Wonderful photo. 9', '2005-05-12 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381244, 176547, 25655, '<td valign="top">how beautiful.<br/>The colors are great, the framing also works here nicely.<br/>A very nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'how beautiful.The colors are great, the framing also works here nicely.A very nice take on the challenge.', '2005-05-12 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381248, 175182, 25943, '<td valign="top">Man, thats a really small triangle! But thats the challenge. Would liked to of seen the bird a bit bigger.</td>', 'Man, thats a really small triangle! But thats the challenge. Would liked to of seen the bird a bit bigger.', '2005-05-12 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381251, 176615, 25655, '<td valign="top">Many photos in the challenge are of people triangeling their hands like you did here. But personally I think this one is the best of them.<br/>The lighting is perfect, the details and focus are excellent, the texture is causing a very unique feel to this one.<br/>(and I really like those marks on your hands)<br/>Wonderful take on this challenge!</td>', 'Many photos in the challenge are of people triangeling their hands like you did here. But personally I think this one is the best of them.The lighting is perfect, the details and focus are excellent, the texture is causing a very unique feel to this one.(and I really like those marks on your hands)Wonderful take on this challenge!', '2005-05-12 13:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381254, 174816, 25943, '<td valign="top">Sad to see the drive-ins disappearing..........nice shot.</td>', 'Sad to see the drive-ins disappearing..........nice shot.', '2005-05-12 13:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381259, 174063, 19010, '<td valign="top">This has a triagle in it however it does not have enough details or color to cary much of an impact. I can only guess this was a glass with triagle shapes formes into it''s side. I think that a little broader shot with a more apealing color would have worked better.</td>', 'This has a triagle in it however it does not have enough details or color to cary much of an impact. I can only guess this was a glass with triagle shapes formes into it''s side. I think that a little broader shot with a more apealing color would have worked better.', '2005-05-12 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381261, 174729, 31443, '<td valign="top">What a shame this hardly or not at all meets the challenge! Beautiful photo and oh my goodness it could have been perfect for the Silhouette!!!!</td>', 'What a shame this hardly or not at all meets the challenge! Beautiful photo and oh my goodness it could have been perfect for the Silhouette!!!!', '2005-05-12 13:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381279, 176554, 3087, '<td valign="top">Shiny skin lets this down overall for me but the composition works well and the eye contact too.</td>', 'Shiny skin lets this down overall for me but the composition works well and the eye contact too.', '2005-05-12 13:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381280, 176059, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the nose and nice blurring elsewhere from the shallow DOF. Seems to be a bit of blow out in the white area near the nose?</td>', 'Nice detail in the nose and nice blurring elsewhere from the shallow DOF. Seems to be a bit of blow out in the white area near the nose?', '2005-05-12 13:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381282, 175888, 19010, '<td valign="top">While this fits the challenge perfectly, I find the image to be a bit bland. The metalic surfaces look great. I don''t however care for the sickly yellow cast over the rest of the shot. Interesting concept and with a little diferent composition and some whiter floors this one might have amazed the masses.</td>', 'While this fits the challenge perfectly, I find the image to be a bit bland. The metalic surfaces look great. I don''t however care for the sickly yellow cast over the rest of the shot. Interesting concept and with a little diferent composition and some whiter floors this one might have amazed the masses.', '2005-05-12 13:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381285, 175750, 34396, '<td valign="top">Probably not a good idea to have your triangles almost entirely covered by the tree branches.  That said, I really like the photo.  Very nice colors and lighting.  Great DOF.</td>', 'Probably not a good idea to have your triangles almost entirely covered by the tree branches.  That said, I really like the photo.  Very nice colors and lighting.  Great DOF.', '2005-05-12 13:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381290, 174938, 25655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.<br/>I love the DOF and colors so much. A wonderful triangle for this challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful.I love the DOF and colors so much. A wonderful triangle for this challenge!', '2005-05-12 13:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381291, 176553, 36199, '<td valign="top">good title, nice image</td>', 'good title, nice image', '2005-05-12 13:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381292, 176567, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, let down by poor lighting, lack of sharp focus and colour imbalance.</td>', 'Nice idea, let down by poor lighting, lack of sharp focus and colour imbalance.', '2005-05-12 13:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381294, 175465, 19010, '<td valign="top">A little to fuzzy to capture all of the gracefull curves of the car. If this was and inetional effect then I might recomend stareing with a sharpphoto with solid lines and using a strong linier gassian blur to give it an imopressionistic effect. As it stands no it just lacs the crispness to make this an exciting shot.</td>', 'A little to fuzzy to capture all of the gracefull curves of the car. If this was and inetional effect then I might recomend stareing with a sharpphoto with solid lines and using a strong linier gassian blur to give it an imopressionistic effect. As it stands no it just lacs the crispness to make this an exciting shot.', '2005-05-12 13:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381300, 176118, 19010, '<td valign="top">I see the triangles on the side walk and will acknowledge it fits the challenge. However the image is a bit small, the title is confusing and the dog is out of focus. With a slightly diffent crop and a crisper image this might have done pretty well.</td>', 'I see the triangles on the side walk and will acknowledge it fits the challenge. However the image is a bit small, the title is confusing and the dog is out of focus. With a slightly diffent crop and a crisper image this might have done pretty well.', '2005-05-12 13:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381313, 175851, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! Not so keen on the tight, upright ratio but the colours and content are great.</td>', 'Cute! Not so keen on the tight, upright ratio but the colours and content are great.', '2005-05-12 13:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381319, 175748, 36199, '<td valign="top">unusual angle, i think i might have preferred it the right way up, still a nice shot.</td>', 'unusual angle, i think i might have preferred it the right way up, still a nice shot.', '2005-05-12 13:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381321, 176458, 19010, '<td valign="top">There were several shots of the Louve in this one but this was by far the best. The lighting and tonal range realy give a strong and mood inducing atmospher. One of my top 2 picks of the challenge Wonderfull job.</td>', 'There were several shots of the Louve in this one but this was by far the best. The lighting and tonal range realy give a strong and mood inducing atmospher. One of my top 2 picks of the challenge Wonderfull job.', '2005-05-12 13:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
