(1381332, 175634, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like high contrast but this is pumped up a bit too high even for me. Sky lacks detail to the point that it almost looks unatural against the richness of tone and contrast below. Like the content though.</td>', 'I like high contrast but this is pumped up a bit too high even for me. Sky lacks detail to the point that it almost looks unatural against the richness of tone and contrast below. Like the content though.', '2005-05-12 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
