(1381341, 176519, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  It got one of the two 10''s I handed out.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this shot.  It got one of the two 10''s I handed out.  Good luck!', '2005-05-12 14:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
