(1381531, 176219, 19010, '<td valign="top">I think I see the concept you had with just leaving three of the points in focus. This does not work very well for me it leaves too much of the pfoto out of focus. Perhaps if it were a closer shot making the points larger that would have worked realy well. This is still a great idea keep up the nice work!!</td>', 'I think I see the concept you had with just leaving three of the points in focus. This does not work very well for me it leaves too much of the pfoto out of focus. Perhaps if it were a closer shot making the points larger that would have worked realy well. This is still a great idea keep up the nice work!!', '2005-05-12 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381533, 175969, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation of natural triangular shapes. I''d wish here for more contrasty tones, and personally, the white part of the border competes instead of compliments the white elements in the image.</td>', 'Nice presentation of natural triangular shapes. I''d wish here for more contrasty tones, and personally, the white part of the border competes instead of compliments the white elements in the image.', '2005-05-12 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381542, 176459, 34247, '<td valign="top">I usually like grain in images, but in this case, with the obviously ample lighting source, I feel the grain does a disservice to the image''s potential impact.</td>', 'I usually like grain in images, but in this case, with the obviously ample lighting source, I feel the grain does a disservice to the image''s potential impact.', '2005-05-12 15:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381545, 175711, 34396, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo.  Really looking for a triangle here, but don''t see it.    Three points of the boat?  Possibly, but just too vague.</td>', 'A beautiful photo.  Really looking for a triangle here, but don''t see it.    Three points of the boat?  Possibly, but just too vague.', '2005-05-12 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
