(1381556, 176452, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very strong triangle fee without an actual triangle great job. I just love the richness of the colors and the increadable amount of betail you managed to capture. All around great image 8</td>', 'Very strong triangle fee without an actual triangle great job. I just love the richness of the colors and the increadable amount of betail you managed to capture. All around great image 8', '2005-05-12 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
