(1381585, 176000, 19010, '<td valign="top">Interesting statues but I a triangle is a bit of a streatch IMO. Nice shot but does not fit the challenge. But they are some realy neat statues i look forward to seeing where this was shot.</td>', 'Interesting statues but I a triangle is a bit of a streatch IMO. Nice shot but does not fit the challenge. But they are some realy neat statues i look forward to seeing where this was shot.', '2005-05-12 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381587, 175550, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections and architectural feel to this image. The juxtaposition of the old and modern also registers well. I do feel, however, the color tones are a bit bland and the image could have benefited from tweaking levels, saturation, etc, which if performed would create more drama in the shot, imho.</td>', 'Nice reflections and architectural feel to this image. The juxtaposition of the old and modern also registers well. I do feel, however, the color tones are a bit bland and the image could have benefited from tweaking levels, saturation, etc, which if performed would create more drama in the shot, imho.', '2005-05-12 15:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381589, 176456, 19010, '<td valign="top">I too simple yet I like this one. Interesting yet not exciting. My opinions are all scrampled when it comes to this one. I think I like it so i''m going with a 7</td>', 'I too simple yet I like this one. Interesting yet not exciting. My opinions are all scrampled when it comes to this one. I think I like it so i''m going with a 7', '2005-05-12 15:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381591, 176026, 34247, '<td valign="top">The dof choice doesn''t work for me here, although this image i think has a lot of potential. I most like the minimalist set up and composition. I do feel this should be "moodier" with perhaps a different lighting choice to create a darker, less black and white tonalities.</td>', 'The dof choice doesn''t work for me here, although this image i think has a lot of potential. I most like the minimalist set up and composition. I do feel this should be "moodier" with perhaps a different lighting choice to create a darker, less black and white tonalities.', '2005-05-12 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381594, 175225, 19010, '<td valign="top">Siple and unexciting. But somthing realy stands out in this shot the wood grains the composition. I don''t know. While not a wow photo it just seems right. 6</td>', 'Siple and unexciting. But somthing realy stands out in this shot the wood grains the composition. I don''t know. While not a wow photo it just seems right. 6', '2005-05-12 15:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381596, 174560, 34247, '<td valign="top">As it stands for me, it''s a 6 shot. Bumping up contrast and creating a harsher mood would have been very effective, imho.</td>', 'As it stands for me, it''s a 6 shot. Bumping up contrast and creating a harsher mood would have been very effective, imho.', '2005-05-12 15:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381599, 176503, 19010, '<td valign="top">Strong triangles and great colors. Just lacks interest. Perfect shot of a magnificent stage but it seems to be missing and actor. 6</td>', 'Strong triangles and great colors. Just lacks interest. Perfect shot of a magnificent stage but it seems to be missing and actor. 6', '2005-05-12 15:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381602, 175103, 19010, '<td valign="top">Now thats a triangle I would not have ever thought of. great find very original.  Wonderfull color and a textbook perfect use of DOF. Great job!!!</td>', 'Now thats a triangle I would not have ever thought of. great find very original.  Wonderfull color and a textbook perfect use of DOF. Great job!!!', '2005-05-12 15:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
