(1381788, 176180, 33732, '<td valign="top">This has good composition to accenuate the shape but does not offer something dramatic as per the title.</td>', 'This has good composition to accenuate the shape but does not offer something dramatic as per the title.', '2005-05-12 17:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381789, 176588, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea. Fits the challenge well IMO. Focus and lighting/exposure are not bad. Compositionally, I see a traditional angle/perspective that works well in this case. I like the tree branches in the top left, feels like they enhance the empty blue sky a little, and complement a good strong line formed by the three peaks of the spires.  A couple things that seem like could strengthen the presentation of this photo is in the framing, a little of the foreground cropped out, the little ''island'' thingy in the bottom left doesn''t seem to add to the shot, just a distracting element. Also, the shot seems to be a little slanted, which can be straightened in editing with arbitrary rotation.</td>', 'This is a nice idea. Fits the challenge well IMO. Focus and lighting/exposure are not bad. Compositionally, I see a traditional angle/perspective that works well in this case. I like the tree branches in the top left, feels like they enhance the empty blue sky a little, and complement a good strong line formed by the three peaks of the spires.  A couple things that seem like could strengthen the presentation of this photo is in the framing, a little of the foreground cropped out, the little ''island'' thingy in the bottom left doesn''t seem to add to the shot, just a distracting element. Also, the shot seems to be a little slanted, which can be straightened in editing with arbitrary rotation.', '2005-05-12 17:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381790, 175264, 33732, '<td valign="top">The triangle is not very impressive to me.</td>', 'The triangle is not very impressive to me.', '2005-05-12 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381792, 176567, 33732, '<td valign="top">Creative.</td>', 'Creative.', '2005-05-12 17:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
