(1381799, 175896, 35741, '<td valign="top">This photo would succeed in a competition under a different title, for example "Reflection", "Window" etc. A beautiful, well composed shot but the "Triangle" is not the thing that comes to mind.</td>', 'This photo would succeed in a competition under a different title, for example "Reflection", "Window" etc. A beautiful, well composed shot but the "Triangle" is not the thing that comes to mind.', '2005-05-12 17:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
