(1382358, 175669, 25309, '<td valign="top">nice colors, unfortunately the name do not indicate anything else than what we already know...  also the sun is too hard, did you take this around 1pm? try it early morning.</td>', 'nice colors, unfortunately the name do not indicate anything else than what we already know...  also the sun is too hard, did you take this around 1pm? try it early morning.', '2005-05-12 21:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382367, 176030, 25309, '<td valign="top">It look like a photo from a design magazine. The light is well balanced, the perspective is interesting. But reading the picture would suggest we would find something in the floor. where is the trianlge? my eyes can''t find it easely.</td>', 'It look like a photo from a design magazine. The light is well balanced, the perspective is interesting. But reading the picture would suggest we would find something in the floor. where is the trianlge? my eyes can''t find it easely.', '2005-05-12 21:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
