(1382376, 174577, 25309, '<td valign="top">I can see a depth of field issue in this photo. Since it''s static, you should have used a great  f-number to have more depth of field. The part of the breat close to use is not clear, then the image is not sharp. Lack of light also. But the idea is clever, the tree cumcumber could have been aligned some how with the bread to have another triangle.</td>', 'I can see a depth of field issue in this photo. Since it''s static, you should have used a great  f-number to have more depth of field. The part of the breat close to use is not clear, then the image is not sharp. Lack of light also. But the idea is clever, the tree cumcumber could have been aligned some how with the bread to have another triangle.', '2005-05-12 21:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382383, 176729, 25309, '<td valign="top">that''s the point, when we say a photo is like a 1000 word, we should not have the title of the photo tell us where to look ;). I guessed about the GT40, but I don''t understand the photo. Please explain if you care ;)</td>', 'that''s the point, when we say a photo is like a 1000 word, we should not have the title of the photo tell us where to look ;). I guessed about the GT40, but I don''t understand the photo. Please explain if you care ;)', '2005-05-12 21:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
