(1383037, 176055, 34396, '<td valign="top">Did you staple liver to the steps to get all of those dogs to stay there for the photo?  I know how hard it is to get that many dogs to sit still!  Good job posing them.  A couple of thoughts.  When submitting photos, try to make at least one dimension the maximum allowable for DPC, 640 Pixels.  People HATE small photos here.  Less than 640 and you are cheating yourself.  I also found it helpful to change the size, then do a final sharpening, looking at it at 100% resolution.</td>', 'Did you staple liver to the steps to get all of those dogs to stay there for the photo?  I know how hard it is to get that many dogs to sit still!  Good job posing them.  A couple of thoughts.  When submitting photos, try to make at least one dimension the maximum allowable for DPC, 640 Pixels.  People HATE small photos here.  Less than 640 and you are cheating yourself.  I also found it helpful to change the size, then do a final sharpening, looking at it at 100% resolution.', '2005-05-13 02:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
