(1383091, 176604, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool off kilter angle...lighting/shadows works well, except the lighting on the actual cards.  I like the yellow background choice and the heirarchy of royalty (though that sneaky Jack of Spades jumped into the house where Mr. Jack Clubs belonged!)</td>', 'Cool off kilter angle...lighting/shadows works well, except the lighting on the actual cards.  I like the yellow background choice and the heirarchy of royalty (though that sneaky Jack of Spades jumped into the house where Mr. Jack Clubs belonged!)', '2005-05-13 03:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
