(1383281, 174322, 19010, '<td valign="top">A couple of boring old chairs. WOW you made them look realy nice. Spectacular use of lighting and shadows. You turned what would have score most people a 3 into an awsom shot worthy of an 8 great job. My only moplaint is the yellow light spot on the left chair.</td>', 'A couple of boring old chairs. WOW you made them look realy nice. Spectacular use of lighting and shadows. You turned what would have score most people a 3 into an awsom shot worthy of an 8 great job. My only moplaint is the yellow light spot on the left chair.', '2005-05-13 08:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
