(1383509, 176244, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very fun photo too look at. Great piece of abstract work. I can''t realy tell how this was done. But it is unmiportaint. The part that matters is this is a great shot that fits the challenge perfectly. Wonderfull job. 8</td>', 'Very fun photo too look at. Great piece of abstract work. I can''t realy tell how this was done. But it is unmiportaint. The part that matters is this is a great shot that fits the challenge perfectly. Wonderfull job. 8', '2005-05-13 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
