(1383641, 176030, 19010, '<td valign="top">Technicaly this photo is pretty good. Nice shadows, nice color and lighting,  and it even had an interesting perspective. I see two large problems with this shot. It has triangles in it but they are not very strong. If they had been somehow been pulled to the center of the image making it the center of intrest it might have worked a little better. Secondly it is pretty bland. There is no action, character, or anything to give this shat a breath of life. The image feels a bit stale to me it is a beautifull stage it just dosn''t have an actor. 5</td>', 'Technicaly this photo is pretty good. Nice shadows, nice color and lighting,  and it even had an interesting perspective. I see two large problems with this shot. It has triangles in it but they are not very strong. If they had been somehow been pulled to the center of the image making it the center of intrest it might have worked a little better. Secondly it is pretty bland. There is no action, character, or anything to give this shat a breath of life. The image feels a bit stale to me it is a beautifull stage it just dosn''t have an actor. 5', '2005-05-13 12:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
