(1384478, 174148, 27735, '<td valign="top">Very cool duotone! 8</td>', 'Very cool duotone! 8', '2005-05-13 21:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384482, 175212, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of my highest scorers. (maybe I just love salsa.)  The colors are very real, the crop is interesting and the only thing that keeps this from being a perfect photo is that the blue seems to saturated and mixes with the edge of the glass.</td>', 'One of my highest scorers. (maybe I just love salsa.)  The colors are very real, the crop is interesting and the only thing that keeps this from being a perfect photo is that the blue seems to saturated and mixes with the edge of the glass.', '2005-05-13 21:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384542, 176554, 37423, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT IDEA.  I LOVE HOW THE SHADOW SEPERATES THE EYE FROM THE HANDS.</td>', 'EXCELLENT IDEA.  I LOVE HOW THE SHADOW SEPERATES THE EYE FROM THE HANDS.', '2005-05-13 22:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384549, 176727, 36981, '<td valign="top">How nice it would have been to have seen a shadow!  Nice details, nonetheless.</td>', 'How nice it would have been to have seen a shadow!  Nice details, nonetheless.', '2005-05-13 22:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384550, 175748, 37423, '<td valign="top">i LOVE IT<br/></td>', 'i LOVE IT', '2005-05-13 22:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384661, 176730, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait, nice skin tones and very flattering light.  I like the "softness" of the photo, also a very flattering thing to do.  I think the one big downfall you may see from the voters is that your triangle is very low key.  it is not a major element of the photograph and thus you are apt to get many "does not meet the chalenge" comments.  This is bound to become a favorite photograph of the model though.  It deserves a frame of its own on the night stand or desk.  Well done and good luck.</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait, nice skin tones and very flattering light.  I like the "softness" of the photo, also a very flattering thing to do.  I think the one big downfall you may see from the voters is that your triangle is very low key.  it is not a major element of the photograph and thus you are apt to get many "does not meet the chalenge" comments.  This is bound to become a favorite photograph of the model though.  It deserves a frame of its own on the night stand or desk.  Well done and good luck.', '2005-05-13 23:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384670, 175892, 18868, '<td valign="top">ingenious!</td>', 'ingenious!', '2005-05-13 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384679, 176206, 18868, '<td valign="top">very cautious neignborhood you live in...</td>', 'very cautious neignborhood you live in...', '2005-05-13 23:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384687, 176604, 18868, '<td valign="top">good idea, interesting crop, the color balance could have been adjusted so the cards look white</td>', 'good idea, interesting crop, the color balance could have been adjusted so the cards look white', '2005-05-14 00:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384697, 176486, 18868, '<td valign="top">ladies and gentlemen, the envelope please... <br/> <br/>GORGEOUS!  I really like the strong graphic element, and your image is tack-sharp.  Well done.</td>', 'ladies and gentlemen, the envelope please...  GORGEOUS!  I really like the strong graphic element, and your image is tack-sharp.  Well done.', '2005-05-14 00:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384703, 176564, 18868, '<td valign="top">technically, that would be pressed glass.  Cut glass has crisp, sharp edges.  Interesting idea, tough subject tho.  Perhaps too much contrast...</td>', 'technically, that would be pressed glass.  Cut glass has crisp, sharp edges.  Interesting idea, tough subject tho.  Perhaps too much contrast...', '2005-05-14 00:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384721, 174727, 18868, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea, pretty over the top on the studio set up.  The harsh lighting (is it backlight?) is really a downer -- this wants to be a sexy, sultry image, not a cold, clinical, artificial image.  Imagine the same main subject but having it hung off a ceiling fan -- or another equally inappropriate place -- with soft, slanting light like early am hours... less clutter, more implication of incendiary whoopie.</td>', 'Fabulous idea, pretty over the top on the studio set up.  The harsh lighting (is it backlight?) is really a downer -- this wants to be a sexy, sultry image, not a cold, clinical, artificial image.  Imagine the same main subject but having it hung off a ceiling fan -- or another equally inappropriate place -- with soft, slanting light like early am hours... less clutter, more implication of incendiary whoopie.', '2005-05-14 00:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384726, 176430, 18868, '<td valign="top">very much like the famous Escher print.  The setup shows thought.  Perhaps using a very tight apeture would allow both the distant-reflected image and the foreground to be in focus.</td>', 'very much like the famous Escher print.  The setup shows thought.  Perhaps using a very tight apeture would allow both the distant-reflected image and the foreground to be in focus.', '2005-05-14 00:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384735, 174245, 18868, '<td valign="top">Setting the color balance on your camera so the studs reflect a neutral color will improve this image a great deal -- as would conversion to B&amp;W.</td>', 'Setting the color balance on your camera so the studs reflect a neutral color will improve this image a great deal -- as would conversion to B&W.', '2005-05-14 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384831, 175103, 29442, '<td valign="top">Great macro, focus on face and front legs works great.</td>', 'Great macro, focus on face and front legs works great.', '2005-05-14 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384837, 176452, 29442, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great close up! I can''t wait to see the details of this shot.</td>', 'Wow, what a great close up! I can''t wait to see the details of this shot.', '2005-05-14 01:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384891, 176219, 37302, '<td valign="top">Nice shot 7 --would be higher but I would hav liked to see a strongr focal point</td>', 'Nice shot 7 --would be higher but I would hav liked to see a strongr focal point', '2005-05-14 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384896, 174214, 34390, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I hope you didn''t have to dig it up just for the contest! Good photo.</td>', 'Interesting.  I hope you didn''t have to dig it up just for the contest! Good photo.', '2005-05-14 01:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384899, 176541, 34390, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadows. Nice job.</td>', 'Good use of shadows. Nice job.', '2005-05-14 01:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384902, 176519, 34390, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Clever way to get the triangle!</td>', 'Cute shot.  Clever way to get the triangle!', '2005-05-14 01:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384913, 174889, 34390, '<td valign="top">Good job. Too bad the skin on the right side is showing. Would have been nice with just the one triangle.</td>', 'Good job. Too bad the skin on the right side is showing. Would have been nice with just the one triangle.', '2005-05-14 01:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384920, 176196, 34390, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I might have left off the little character. It takes away from the focus on the triangle theme.</td>', 'Good photo. I might have left off the little character. It takes away from the focus on the triangle theme.', '2005-05-14 01:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384923, 176114, 34390, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The triangle is nicely lit. The whole picture is nice!</td>', 'Nice photo. The triangle is nicely lit. The whole picture is nice!', '2005-05-14 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384927, 176236, 34390, '<td valign="top">Aaarrgghh! This is the same thing I entered. Yours is better than mine, though. Good luck!</td>', 'Aaarrgghh! This is the same thing I entered. Yours is better than mine, though. Good luck!', '2005-05-14 01:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384930, 176445, 34390, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good depth of field too.</td>', 'I like this. Good depth of field too.', '2005-05-14 01:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384937, 176196, 37302, '<td valign="top">OMG that is so funny I love it 10 for humor originality and great shot too!</td>', 'OMG that is so funny I love it 10 for humor originality and great shot too!', '2005-05-14 02:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384939, 176395, 34390, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this beautiful bird.</td>', 'Nice capture of this beautiful bird.', '2005-05-14 02:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1384945, 175263, 34390, '<td valign="top">Set up nicely. Very effective triangle!</td>', 'Set up nicely. Very effective triangle!', '2005-05-14 02:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
