(1385035, 175007, 36547, '<td valign="top">How did you get the pic so sharp? I''ve been stuggling with this. The only comment I have is that it''s so sharp it almost seems cut out and stuck on the sky background. Great picture though, especially like the foreground.</td>', 'How did you get the pic so sharp? I''ve been stuggling with this. The only comment I have is that it''s so sharp it almost seems cut out and stuck on the sky background. Great picture though, especially like the foreground.', '2005-05-14 03:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385039, 175373, 36547, '<td valign="top">Pity about the harsh glare in the lower right corner</td>', 'Pity about the harsh glare in the lower right corner', '2005-05-14 03:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385040, 176486, 36547, '<td valign="top">Great pic. Well done.</td>', 'Great pic. Well done.', '2005-05-14 03:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385048, 176347, 35169, '<td valign="top">The background is an asset to the whole image.  Good Job with the tones. and focus.  (There are some wrinkles in the background that show as dark areas, something to avoid next time)</td>', 'The background is an asset to the whole image.  Good Job with the tones. and focus.  (There are some wrinkles in the background that show as dark areas, something to avoid next time)', '2005-05-14 03:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385053, 174929, 35169, '<td valign="top">The backgrnd is dark and abstract in contrast to the flowers.  The yellow frame appears to be thicker on the bottom than on the top and left side, maybe that is an illussion.  Triangles have three distinct straight sides and although you imply a third side with the yellow frame .....</td>', 'The backgrnd is dark and abstract in contrast to the flowers.  The yellow frame appears to be thicker on the bottom than on the top and left side, maybe that is an illussion.  Triangles have three distinct straight sides and although you imply a third side with the yellow frame .....', '2005-05-14 03:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385056, 176726, 35169, '<td valign="top">There must be a good story to go with this image, beatiful color and composition</td>', 'There must be a good story to go with this image, beatiful color and composition', '2005-05-14 03:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385060, 175582, 35169, '<td valign="top">What a neat image, tonal quality is very interesting.  Some light on the blades would be terrific.  I find the halos around the trees to be obvious and distracting (overshrp) while the windmill looks pretty good except for the blades.   Overall a nice image.</td>', 'What a neat image, tonal quality is very interesting.  Some light on the blades would be terrific.  I find the halos around the trees to be obvious and distracting (overshrp) while the windmill looks pretty good except for the blades.   Overall a nice image.', '2005-05-14 03:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385061, 176605, 35169, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting a triangle here... nice looking flower though.</td>', 'I''m not getting a triangle here... nice looking flower though.', '2005-05-14 03:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385067, 176310, 35169, '<td valign="top">Good composition, the image is thin tho.  An adjustment issue?</td>', 'Good composition, the image is thin tho.  An adjustment issue?', '2005-05-14 04:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385069, 176383, 35169, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  I do find the embroidery to be a distraction to the subject matter.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  I do find the embroidery to be a distraction to the subject matter.', '2005-05-14 04:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385072, 175497, 35169, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the material in the triangle,, sparkly or something. I do like the composition.  Its interesting and makes you think.</td>', 'I don''t like the material in the triangle,, sparkly or something. I do like the composition.  Its interesting and makes you think.', '2005-05-14 04:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385073, 174341, 35169, '<td valign="top">Generally triangles are composed of 3 straight sides, even loosely translated the 2 balls in the front are not triangles_but who cares.  The colors are way to saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Generally triangles are composed of 3 straight sides, even loosely translated the 2 balls in the front are not triangles_but who cares.  The colors are way to saturated for my taste.', '2005-05-14 04:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385078, 175414, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very clever shot. Focus and lighting are geat. I really like how you''ve composed the text into a triangle. Quite creative, well done.</td>', 'Very clever shot. Focus and lighting are geat. I really like how you''ve composed the text into a triangle. Quite creative, well done.', '2005-05-14 04:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385081, 174901, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. I like this shot. Good job.</td>', 'Very cool perspective. I like this shot. Good job.', '2005-05-14 04:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385086, 174916, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''m not quite sure what this is, but I do find it an amazing photo. A highly intrigueing and interesting abstract. The shapes present have a great flow, and mix together very well. The textures are awesome, I feel compelled to reach out and try to touch it. Forms, lines, angles, the play of lights and darks, this just is really great IMO. I am truly enjoying studying this image, quite pleasing. Very creative, very unique, very fresh and original, and oh yeah, I think it fits the challenge spot on! I sincerely hope this entry does very well in the scoring and comments, I love it. Outstanding work, thank-you.</td>', 'Wow! I''m not quite sure what this is, but I do find it an amazing photo. A highly intrigueing and interesting abstract. The shapes present have a great flow, and mix together very well. The textures are awesome, I feel compelled to reach out and try to touch it. Forms, lines, angles, the play of lights and darks, this just is really great IMO. I am truly enjoying studying this image, quite pleasing. Very creative, very unique, very fresh and original, and oh yeah, I think it fits the challenge spot on! I sincerely hope this entry does very well in the scoring and comments, I love it. Outstanding work, thank-you.', '2005-05-14 04:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385115, 176458, 36698, '<td valign="top">My brother visited this not to long ago and hes got a cool shot of it too. This one is very well framed and the lighting was pulled off well 7</td>', 'My brother visited this not to long ago and hes got a cool shot of it too. This one is very well framed and the lighting was pulled off well 7', '2005-05-14 06:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385121, 176371, 36698, '<td valign="top">What a winner this better do well its such a cool shot and A wicked title good to see your not scared to be a funny guy or girl. good luck with this one 9</td>', 'What a winner this better do well its such a cool shot and A wicked title good to see your not scared to be a funny guy or girl. good luck with this one 9', '2005-05-14 06:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385135, 176236, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice idea and angle, but the image is out of focus</td>', 'nice idea and angle, but the image is out of focus', '2005-05-14 07:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385136, 176486, 26679, '<td valign="top">This will do well in Silhouette, I like this and I see where you are going with the triangle. I think other may not be as obliging. Anyway this is one of my top 10</td>', 'This will do well in Silhouette, I like this and I see where you are going with the triangle. I think other may not be as obliging. Anyway this is one of my top 10', '2005-05-14 07:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385138, 174807, 18219, '<td valign="top">a good idea, unique, but the flag and other images in the background are very distracting and detracting from the actual boat and triangle.<br/>Taken from a different angle may have yielded a better result?<br/>Maybe not?</td>', 'a good idea, unique, but the flag and other images in the background are very distracting and detracting from the actual boat and triangle.Taken from a different angle may have yielded a better result?Maybe not?', '2005-05-14 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1);
