(1385159, 176219, 26679, '<td valign="top">The idea is excellent  and compositionally there is the potential of great strenth which could be shown to a greatereffect if the focus was more through the image rather than on the few points at the front</td>', 'The idea is excellent  and compositionally there is the potential of great strenth which could be shown to a greatereffect if the focus was more through the image rather than on the few points at the front', '2005-05-14 07:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
