(1385298, 176502, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is one of those imige that is very poignent for those who know its context but does not necessarily translate to others. <br/> I see a simple composition of a what I presume to be a folded US flag mounted in a triangle.<br/> <br/>The centre composition gives a static feel which can be enhanced with a less severe crop allowing the triangle to be moved to either the left or the right hand side</td>', 'This is one of those imige that is very poignent for those who know its context but does not necessarily translate to others.  I see a simple composition of a what I presume to be a folded US flag mounted in a triangle. The centre composition gives a static feel which can be enhanced with a less severe crop allowing the triangle to be moved to either the left or the right hand side', '2005-05-14 10:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
