(1385666, 176615, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool image. I like your idea and presentation and all elements present. <br/>I feel that this image will look even better if saved at a better quality. There''s a lot of detail that''s been taken away because of the compression (I think). You can actually see individual pixels floating around the image. I think it would be worth another try if it wasn''t the camera that did it.</td>', 'Cool image. I like your idea and presentation and all elements present. I feel that this image will look even better if saved at a better quality. There''s a lot of detail that''s been taken away because of the compression (I think). You can actually see individual pixels floating around the image. I think it would be worth another try if it wasn''t the camera that did it.', '2005-05-14 16:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385668, 175316, 37395, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2005-05-14 16:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
