(1385673, 176324, 21714, '<td valign="top">I feel that the shot would have looked better if the boat wasn''t composed so tightly inside the frame. With your title, it feels like you are trying to show how enjoyable and free the experience can be, but in the image, there''s hardly any room left for the boat to move.</td>', 'I feel that the shot would have looked better if the boat wasn''t composed so tightly inside the frame. With your title, it feels like you are trying to show how enjoyable and free the experience can be, but in the image, there''s hardly any room left for the boat to move.', '2005-05-14 16:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385681, 176023, 37395, '<td valign="top">nice<br/>:)</td>', 'nice:)', '2005-05-14 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
