(1385698, 176002, 21714, '<td valign="top">The triangle is definitely very clear and the rock could be very old, but if it''s not a Triangle challenge, would this be an interesting image?<br/>I think even this rock with the same triangle can be made more interesting if you walked around it, get low, shoow from the ground and create some depth. Right now it looks like you have taken a snapshot just as you found it.</td>', 'The triangle is definitely very clear and the rock could be very old, but if it''s not a Triangle challenge, would this be an interesting image?I think even this rock with the same triangle can be made more interesting if you walked around it, get low, shoow from the ground and create some depth. Right now it looks like you have taken a snapshot just as you found it.', '2005-05-14 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385709, 174577, 21714, '<td valign="top">A very well thought out title ;)<br/>I like the diffused lighting in this, but I feel that the arrangement could have been more interesting by using perhaps a wooden cutting board for some nice texture and colour and maybe some care with placement of the sandwich so it would have sharper focus and interest and a bit more interesting pieces of fruitty bits.</td>', 'A very well thought out title ;)I like the diffused lighting in this, but I feel that the arrangement could have been more interesting by using perhaps a wooden cutting board for some nice texture and colour and maybe some care with placement of the sandwich so it would have sharper focus and interest and a bit more interesting pieces of fruitty bits.', '2005-05-14 16:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385712, 176352, 21714, '<td valign="top">Like the vacuum created by it. Feels like I could be sucked into that gap. No, I don''t have a bong with me.</td>', 'Like the vacuum created by it. Feels like I could be sucked into that gap. No, I don''t have a bong with me.', '2005-05-14 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385718, 174560, 21714, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The tilted pot makes the the whole image work.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The tilted pot makes the the whole image work.', '2005-05-14 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
