(1385776, 176519, 24272, '<td valign="top">I am amazed you were able to get the child to hold the pose long enough for the shot!  I really like this one and wish you much luck!  If I were going to critique about anything, it would be the right hand being a little too blown out as it draws my eyes from the childs eye...</td>', 'I am amazed you were able to get the child to hold the pose long enough for the shot!  I really like this one and wish you much luck!  If I were going to critique about anything, it would be the right hand being a little too blown out as it draws my eyes from the childs eye...', '2005-05-14 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385792, 176055, 32572, '<td valign="top">9!  Great shot, love the idea - especially the originality of it.  A little sharper and it would have been a 10.  Hope you didn''t have to sacrifice some of the clarity just to post it on the website.  I know that can happen and it SUCKS!</td>', '9!  Great shot, love the idea - especially the originality of it.  A little sharper and it would have been a 10.  Hope you didn''t have to sacrifice some of the clarity just to post it on the website.  I know that can happen and it SUCKS!', '2005-05-14 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
