(1385830, 176444, 32572, '<td valign="top">Great shot, beautiful!  Perfect crop.  Meets the challenge! ("this basic shape is clearly shown as a key element").  Makes me feel melancholy and peace at the same time.  The title does nothing for me, but fortunately the photo stands on it''s own.  I want to give this a 9 just because I am reluctant to call anything perfect, but I keep being drawn to it...so THAT deserves a 10.  Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Great shot, beautiful!  Perfect crop.  Meets the challenge! ("this basic shape is clearly shown as a key element").  Makes me feel melancholy and peace at the same time.  The title does nothing for me, but fortunately the photo stands on it''s own.  I want to give this a 9 just because I am reluctant to call anything perfect, but I keep being drawn to it...so THAT deserves a 10.  Good luck!', '2005-05-14 18:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385833, 176056, 32572, '<td valign="top">Love this shot and the title really enhances it.  Feel it met the challenge well.  Could have done without the mom in the shot, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Love this shot and the title really enhances it.  Feel it met the challenge well.  Could have done without the mom in the shot, but that''s just my opinion.', '2005-05-14 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
