(1385845, 174945, 32572, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear...met the challenge...makes me feel wistful and silly...original idea. Don''t care for the title - think it''s too wordy and blatant, but the photo is so damn good I don''t care! 10.</td>', 'Crystal clear...met the challenge...makes me feel wistful and silly...original idea. Don''t care for the title - think it''s too wordy and blatant, but the photo is so damn good I don''t care! 10.', '2005-05-14 18:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
