(1385870, 175263, 18799, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective design, attention to detail choosing the cards, and finished off with a nice b/w conversion.   While I wasn''t keen on all the other house of cards renditions, I find that I like this one a lot.  9</td>', 'Simple and effective design, attention to detail choosing the cards, and finished off with a nice b/w conversion.   While I wasn''t keen on all the other house of cards renditions, I find that I like this one a lot.  9', '2005-05-14 18:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385873, 176422, 18799, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of things I like about this image, particularly the gradients and the diagonal.  I don''t like the hot spot in the lower left though.  7</td>', 'There are a lot of things I like about this image, particularly the gradients and the diagonal.  I don''t like the hot spot in the lower left though.  7', '2005-05-14 18:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385875, 175977, 18799, '<td valign="top">The lighting, exposure and sharpness are all good.  The composition is too centered for my tastes though - diagonals take the eye right to the center and won''t let it leave making the overall impact very static.  6</td>', 'The lighting, exposure and sharpness are all good.  The composition is too centered for my tastes though - diagonals take the eye right to the center and won''t let it leave making the overall impact very static.  6', '2005-05-14 18:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385876, 174729, 18799, '<td valign="top">Is very beautiful, but I don''t think the triangle element is strong enough for the challenge.   Still, a 6.  Much higher in a different challenge</td>', 'Is very beautiful, but I don''t think the triangle element is strong enough for the challenge.   Still, a 6.  Much higher in a different challenge', '2005-05-14 18:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
