(1386285, 174516, 6804, '<td valign="top">Great color selection on this to bring out the aged wood.  Nice border for this shot as well.</td>', 'Great color selection on this to bring out the aged wood.  Nice border for this shot as well.', '2005-05-14 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386292, 176307, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular landscape shot!  The flowers really pull this one all together for me.</td>', 'This is a spectacular landscape shot!  The flowers really pull this one all together for me.', '2005-05-14 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386305, 176244, 6804, '<td valign="top">Really great colors here!  I like the additional grain.   This is an unusual work.  Triangles are easy to see but It bothers me that I can''t figure out what this is a picture of.  (That''s a good thing).  Very unusual shadows and lighting.  I like it!  8</td>', 'Really great colors here!  I like the additional grain.   This is an unusual work.  Triangles are easy to see but It bothers me that I can''t figure out what this is a picture of.  (That''s a good thing).  Very unusual shadows and lighting.  I like it!  8', '2005-05-14 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386315, 175892, 6804, '<td valign="top">I love it!   Great Idea. I see you need the light to create the triangle through the glass,  But how much of the triangle is lost if you also lighten up the darkest area on the right side a little.  You just might be able to keep the bottle from blowing out and have the triangle still show as well.  I don''t know if maybe you already tried playing around with the lighting at all, but if not, it might give you something to try.   I like it.  8</td>', 'I love it!   Great Idea. I see you need the light to create the triangle through the glass,  But how much of the triangle is lost if you also lighten up the darkest area on the right side a little.  You just might be able to keep the bottle from blowing out and have the triangle still show as well.  I don''t know if maybe you already tried playing around with the lighting at all, but if not, it might give you something to try.   I like it.  8', '2005-05-14 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386326, 176553, 6804, '<td valign="top">Excellent!   I love the rust on the blade.</td>', 'Excellent!   I love the rust on the blade.', '2005-05-15 00:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386331, 175359, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed photo... These flowers grow wild around here but they are very hard to find.  I haven''t been able to locate them myself, but I hope to stumble across them one day... excellent work...</td>', 'Beautifully executed photo... These flowers grow wild around here but they are very hard to find.  I haven''t been able to locate them myself, but I hope to stumble across them one day... excellent work...', '2005-05-15 00:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386341, 175486, 6804, '<td valign="top">I like the grit and grain in this shot.  Great coloring.  I like the triangle on the door along with the big ones on the ground.  I think I might have stepped to the right 1-1/2 steps to hide the phone behind the first beam.  I don''t know if you have room to do it, or if it would open up some other distraction by shooting from the new angle.   Just a thought to share.   Good Luck!    8</td>', 'I like the grit and grain in this shot.  Great coloring.  I like the triangle on the door along with the big ones on the ground.  I think I might have stepped to the right 1-1/2 steps to hide the phone behind the first beam.  I don''t know if you have room to do it, or if it would open up some other distraction by shooting from the new angle.   Just a thought to share.   Good Luck!    8', '2005-05-15 00:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386347, 174322, 6804, '<td valign="top">Wow!   Great use of chairs!  Good abstract shot.  (Thank you for telling me they are chairs,  I spend way too much time trying to figure out what it is on some of these abstracts).   I like this in every way.  great lighting and position.  10</td>', 'Wow!   Great use of chairs!  Good abstract shot.  (Thank you for telling me they are chairs,  I spend way too much time trying to figure out what it is on some of these abstracts).   I like this in every way.  great lighting and position.  10', '2005-05-15 00:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
