(1386619, 176523, 36547, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but maybe a little less depth of field to bring a little more of the seed head into focus.</td>', 'I like the idea, but maybe a little less depth of field to bring a little more of the seed head into focus.', '2005-05-15 08:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386620, 175705, 7537, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.... my brain is making up the rest of the picture.. nice sandy beach... blue water.... hot.....mmmmmmmm</td>', 'Nice shot.... my brain is making up the rest of the picture.. nice sandy beach... blue water.... hot.....mmmmmmmm', '2005-05-15 08:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386621, 175414, 36547, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2005-05-15 08:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386623, 175474, 36547, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2005-05-15 08:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386624, 174322, 7537, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.. my eyes are going mental trying to fathom it... righto think my brain undersstands now.. not a big building as i first thaught... <br/> <br/>Very engaging shot... brillant use of light (and dark).. <br/> <br/>I think the shot would be improved <br/>(1) if the triangle was centered... <br/>(2) rotated so the top side of the triangle is parallel with the top...<br/>(3) had a less obvious title.. i think it is more intreguing when it is just abstract shapes! <br/> <br/>Great photo though! 9</td>', 'Awesome shot.. my eyes are going mental trying to fathom it... righto think my brain undersstands now.. not a big building as i first thaught...  Very engaging shot... brillant use of light (and dark)..  I think the shot would be improved (1) if the triangle was centered... (2) rotated so the top side of the triangle is parallel with the top...(3) had a less obvious title.. i think it is more intreguing when it is just abstract shapes!  Great photo though! 9', '2005-05-15 08:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386625, 176306, 36547, '<td valign="top">Original idea!</td>', 'Original idea!', '2005-05-15 08:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386626, 174063, 36547, '<td valign="top">is this in focus?</td>', 'is this in focus?', '2005-05-15 08:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386627, 176247, 7537, '<td valign="top">I love foreground blur, it adds depth and perspective.. but it is a shame that in this case it encroaches (all be it only slightly) on your subject. 7</td>', 'I love foreground blur, it adds depth and perspective.. but it is a shame that in this case it encroaches (all be it only slightly) on your subject. 7', '2005-05-15 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386628, 176188, 7537, '<td valign="top">Would have benefitted from a boost of brightness level.</td>', 'Would have benefitted from a boost of brightness level.', '2005-05-15 08:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386629, 176498, 36547, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little too soft or our of focus.</td>', 'Focus is a little too soft or our of focus.', '2005-05-15 08:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386630, 176474, 7537, '<td valign="top">Might have been an idea to diffuse your light source as the reflection, in my opinion, negitivly effects your image. If it was softened up it could work well. There is also a lot of jpeg artifacts on the table.. if you wanted to get rid of this, try using neat image (www.neatimage.com), works wonders for this problem.</td>', 'Might have been an idea to diffuse your light source as the reflection, in my opinion, negitivly effects your image. If it was softened up it could work well. There is also a lot of jpeg artifacts on the table.. if you wanted to get rid of this, try using neat image (www.neatimage.com), works wonders for this problem.', '2005-05-15 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386631, 174698, 36547, '<td valign="top">Straight line of the roof is distracting</td>', 'Straight line of the roof is distracting', '2005-05-15 08:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386632, 176363, 7537, '<td valign="top">Would have benefited from a bost of brightness and contrast levels.</td>', 'Would have benefited from a bost of brightness and contrast levels.', '2005-05-15 08:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386633, 176731, 7537, '<td valign="top">boost of brightness and contrase may have livened up this image somewhat.</td>', 'boost of brightness and contrase may have livened up this image somewhat.', '2005-05-15 08:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386634, 176486, 7537, '<td valign="top">Great colours!</td>', 'Great colours!', '2005-05-15 08:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386635, 176729, 7537, '<td valign="top">Background disturbs from the photo of the grill (your subject).. but i guess then you wouldnt have any triangles....</td>', 'Background disturbs from the photo of the grill (your subject).. but i guess then you wouldnt have any triangles....', '2005-05-15 08:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386636, 175882, 7537, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.. but feels a little soft on the focus.<br/> <br/>You could also have boosted the colour levels up to get more impact.</td>', 'Nice subject.. but feels a little soft on the focus. You could also have boosted the colour levels up to get more impact.', '2005-05-15 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386638, 174602, 7537, '<td valign="top">boost of brightness and contrase may have livened up this image somewhat.</td>', 'boost of brightness and contrase may have livened up this image somewhat.', '2005-05-15 08:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386639, 175368, 7537, '<td valign="top">Would have been a good idea to diffuse your light source as the shadow really distracts from the image...</td>', 'Would have been a good idea to diffuse your light source as the shadow really distracts from the image...', '2005-05-15 08:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386641, 175386, 7537, '<td valign="top">I think a more interesting point of view would have made for a better photo. perhaps a macro down low, looking along it... getting more of a feel for the texture of the subject.</td>', 'I think a more interesting point of view would have made for a better photo. perhaps a macro down low, looking along it... getting more of a feel for the texture of the subject.', '2005-05-15 08:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386643, 176307, 7537, '<td valign="top">Wow.. great photo.. beautiful colours.. and brilliant framing. Looks like you had some great light to work with that day!</td>', 'Wow.. great photo.. beautiful colours.. and brilliant framing. Looks like you had some great light to work with that day!', '2005-05-15 08:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386644, 175796, 7537, '<td valign="top">boost of brightness and contrase may have livened up this image somewhat.</td>', 'boost of brightness and contrase may have livened up this image somewhat.', '2005-05-15 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386672, 176148, 17850, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice photo, 7</td>', 'Simple and nice photo, 7', '2005-05-15 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386673, 176519, 17850, '<td valign="top">Good idea, image seems a little noisy</td>', 'Good idea, image seems a little noisy', '2005-05-15 10:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
