(1386779, 176526, 6667, '<td valign="top">And a red one on top of it!  Beautiful.</td>', 'And a red one on top of it!  Beautiful.', '2005-05-15 13:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386783, 176056, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too bad the person is in the background.  She kind of spoils the effect.</td>', 'Too bad the person is in the background.  She kind of spoils the effect.', '2005-05-15 13:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386790, 175852, 1202, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your title, as the picture carries the theme quit well without the explanation.   Nice picture.</td>', 'I don''t like your title, as the picture carries the theme quit well without the explanation.   Nice picture.', '2005-05-15 13:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386814, 176135, 30896, '<td valign="top">i would prefer the focus to be on the "hears 9", otherwise not bad</td>', 'i would prefer the focus to be on the "hears 9", otherwise not bad', '2005-05-15 13:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386819, 176452, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The symmetry is perfect, which is hard to pull off in a shot like this. Very original triangle in this one also, but I was so busy admiring the image, I forgot all about the challenge topic, for once. :)</td>', 'Beautiful image. The symmetry is perfect, which is hard to pull off in a shot like this. Very original triangle in this one also, but I was so busy admiring the image, I forgot all about the challenge topic, for once. :)', '2005-05-15 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386820, 175892, 22748, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous image. I really love the simple, soft feel to the image, and the beautiful blue color that dominates it. The refracted light patterns are interesting and I don''t think I''d ever get tired of looking at this framed on my wall.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous image. I really love the simple, soft feel to the image, and the beautiful blue color that dominates it. The refracted light patterns are interesting and I don''t think I''d ever get tired of looking at this framed on my wall.', '2005-05-15 13:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386822, 175432, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome color! Gorgeous simple composition that exudes beauty. The bird is a great addition to the image. Only things I don''t like are the random spots (water drops? dust specks on the sensor?). Still one of the best.</td>', 'Awesome color! Gorgeous simple composition that exudes beauty. The bird is a great addition to the image. Only things I don''t like are the random spots (water drops? dust specks on the sensor?). Still one of the best.', '2005-05-15 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386823, 176023, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very cool triangle. The color of the fire is really unique, I think it''s more interesting this way than if it were orange.</td>', 'Very cool triangle. The color of the fire is really unique, I think it''s more interesting this way than if it were orange.', '2005-05-15 13:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386825, 175316, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very artistic shot. Creative interpretation, it''s really cool how you isolated the triangles. I wonder how you did this, with the black background and everything?</td>', 'Very artistic shot. Creative interpretation, it''s really cool how you isolated the triangles. I wonder how you did this, with the black background and everything?', '2005-05-15 13:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386826, 176546, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great idea, creative title, nice image.</td>', 'Great idea, creative title, nice image.', '2005-05-15 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386829, 175932, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very abstract. Very pretty. I like how the lighting is done, with a bit of a falloff to the edges, and the brightest spot in the center. Mesmerizing image.</td>', 'Very abstract. Very pretty. I like how the lighting is done, with a bit of a falloff to the edges, and the brightest spot in the center. Mesmerizing image.', '2005-05-15 13:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386852, 174134, 18834, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2005-05-15 14:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386873, 176090, 1202, '<td valign="top">The horizontal line is distracting at the top/bottom. A nice picture in original inverted form IMO.</td>', 'The horizontal line is distracting at the top/bottom. A nice picture in original inverted form IMO.', '2005-05-15 14:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386876, 174825, 29904, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably already been told a dozen times that this is out of focus.  Just a tip, I''ve noticed in my short time here that having something in focus is imparative to a decent score, not to mention any decent photo.  If your camera cannot handle up-close or macro, but has a decent mega pixel amount like 3, try backing up, focusing well, and crop out what you don''t want.<br/>Also you''ll find that you will be scored low if your subject is not identifiable.  I don''t know what this is, guessing it''s a gift box?  Good luck in the future, hope this helps.</td>', 'You''ve probably already been told a dozen times that this is out of focus.  Just a tip, I''ve noticed in my short time here that having something in focus is imparative to a decent score, not to mention any decent photo.  If your camera cannot handle up-close or macro, but has a decent mega pixel amount like 3, try backing up, focusing well, and crop out what you don''t want.Also you''ll find that you will be scored low if your subject is not identifiable.  I don''t know what this is, guessing it''s a gift box?  Good luck in the future, hope this helps.', '2005-05-15 14:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1386890, 175796, 35209, '<td valign="top">Love how the focus fades out. It would be nice if the background was a little whiter, but otherwise, lovely photo. And I just got done eating a Toblerone. :)</td>', 'Love how the focus fades out. It would be nice if the background was a little whiter, but otherwise, lovely photo. And I just got done eating a Toblerone. :)', '2005-05-15 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
