(1387639, 176236, 36698, '<td valign="top">Ok. First of all your shit is not in focus you need to get the basics right first im not sure if you tried something fance with depth of field or what but just get it right in future. The composition is quite cool but mind you dont leave to much negative space unless you are trying to show something with it. Lastly your colour balance is way out, it looks like you have three black balls across the front there this is probably due to poor light. An idea would be to take the shot in lighter conditions and darken it in photoshop this would help focus and colour. This gets an "NB" for not bad but surley you can tell if its in focus or not try taking a few hundred shots and selecting from them then you can grab a focused and colourful one for next week.</td>', 'Ok. First of all your shit is not in focus you need to get the basics right first im not sure if you tried something fance with depth of field or what but just get it right in future. The composition is quite cool but mind you dont leave to much negative space unless you are trying to show something with it. Lastly your colour balance is way out, it looks like you have three black balls across the front there this is probably due to poor light. An idea would be to take the shot in lighter conditions and darken it in photoshop this would help focus and colour. This gets an "NB" for not bad but surley you can tell if its in focus or not try taking a few hundred shots and selecting from them then you can grab a focused and colourful one for next week.', '2005-05-16 01:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387677, 176118, 36698, '<td valign="top">Ok lets be honest youre probably going to come last. But heres the good news you can improve for next week, just follow these simple rules. Focus is pleasing toward the eye. Short titles rock harder than ted nugget and the third is that composition is key you have done a good job of composition just work on the others and you will be a dp winner in no time. Keep up the practice.</td>', 'Ok lets be honest youre probably going to come last. But heres the good news you can improve for next week, just follow these simple rules. Focus is pleasing toward the eye. Short titles rock harder than ted nugget and the third is that composition is key you have done a good job of composition just work on the others and you will be a dp winner in no time. Keep up the practice.', '2005-05-16 01:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387743, 176423, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice colors and textures but I would have liked more depth of field so that the entire triangle was in focus</td>', 'nice colors and textures but I would have liked more depth of field so that the entire triangle was in focus', '2005-05-16 01:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
