(1388593, 175271, 25218, '<td valign="top">Very nice - minor complaint: I would have like to have seen the whole of the tree, but from the reflections, it looks like there''s a line of parked cars or something, so I can understand the crop.</td>', 'Very nice - minor complaint: I would have like to have seen the whole of the tree, but from the reflections, it looks like there''s a line of parked cars or something, so I can understand the crop.', '2005-05-16 11:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
