(1388900, 176468, 12962, '<td valign="top">It would have been better if you''ve rotated it a llittle bit anti-clockwise to achieve a perfect symmetry.  But the POV is wonderful, it feels like I am there looking up at the structure with you.</td>', 'It would have been better if you''ve rotated it a llittle bit anti-clockwise to achieve a perfect symmetry.  But the POV is wonderful, it feels like I am there looking up at the structure with you.', '2005-05-16 13:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388909, 176480, 12962, '<td valign="top">An out of the box take on the challenge.  There''s a little bit of gray cast - an adjustment of levels (or curves( would have punched the color, the shadows and the highlights more ... especially that your lighting is beautiful.</td>', 'An out of the box take on the challenge.  There''s a little bit of gray cast - an adjustment of levels (or curves( would have punched the color, the shadows and the highlights more ... especially that your lighting is beautiful.', '2005-05-16 13:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388912, 176529, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating triangles here.  The color combination does not work for me that well, but that''s just me.  The surreal effect is engaging though.</td>', 'I like the repeating triangles here.  The color combination does not work for me that well, but that''s just me.  The surreal effect is engaging though.', '2005-05-16 13:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388913, 176740, 12962, '<td valign="top">Your photograph makes me want to go there and photograph this bridge with you.  I like the point of view here.</td>', 'Your photograph makes me want to go there and photograph this bridge with you.  I like the point of view here.', '2005-05-16 13:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388916, 175297, 12962, '<td valign="top">So many triangles, it''s like a puzzle looking for them.  Good job!</td>', 'So many triangles, it''s like a puzzle looking for them.  Good job!', '2005-05-16 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388920, 176122, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good eye in finding triangles in an ordinary structure like this.  I would have worked on this a little bit more to achieve a perfect symmetry.</td>', 'Good eye in finding triangles in an ordinary structure like this.  I would have worked on this a little bit more to achieve a perfect symmetry.', '2005-05-16 13:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388923, 176423, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice one!  Perhaps a longer depth of field may be in order here, especially to those who are new in the appreciation of DOF.  Some may say the back is blurry or soft focus or something.</td>', 'Nice one!  Perhaps a longer depth of field may be in order here, especially to those who are new in the appreciation of DOF.  Some may say the back is blurry or soft focus or something.', '2005-05-16 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388925, 174816, 12962, '<td valign="top">The triangular repeats are beautiful, it''s like a scavenging hunt ... a contest for how many triangles can you see!</td>', 'The triangular repeats are beautiful, it''s like a scavenging hunt ... a contest for how many triangles can you see!', '2005-05-16 13:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388929, 174292, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good choice of background color to emphasize the repeats.  Side lighting is great.</td>', 'Good choice of background color to emphasize the repeats.  Side lighting is great.', '2005-05-16 13:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388939, 176178, 12962, '<td valign="top">Great job seeing this structure to illustrate repeats.  I would have darkened this a little bit by curves or leves to show more differences in tones.  If you have a chance to go back and take another shot, you might want to place the trees/shrubs more to the side (either left or right), rather than the center because they hog attention more than the globe.  Move around with your camera until you find a location to shoot without the distraction.</td>', 'Great job seeing this structure to illustrate repeats.  I would have darkened this a little bit by curves or leves to show more differences in tones.  If you have a chance to go back and take another shot, you might want to place the trees/shrubs more to the side (either left or right), rather than the center because they hog attention more than the globe.  Move around with your camera until you find a location to shoot without the distraction.', '2005-05-16 14:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388942, 176498, 12962, '<td valign="top">What an eye you have to find this!  Focus is a little bit soft but it''s a great example of geometry in nature.</td>', 'What an eye you have to find this!  Focus is a little bit soft but it''s a great example of geometry in nature.', '2005-05-16 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388943, 176196, 12962, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2005-05-16 14:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388950, 175663, 12962, '<td valign="top">The beauty of this is that you were able to find triangles in the most mundane places.  Colors are good and different textures are very stimulating to the eye.  Good job!</td>', 'The beauty of this is that you were able to find triangles in the most mundane places.  Colors are good and different textures are very stimulating to the eye.  Good job!', '2005-05-16 14:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388954, 175186, 12962, '<td valign="top">A very arty take to enhance attractiveness of your subject.  Good job!</td>', 'A very arty take to enhance attractiveness of your subject.  Good job!', '2005-05-16 14:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388957, 174078, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating elements going away from my eye ... into infinity (well suggested).  I also like the bold colors here.  My only problem is the lighting, too harsh.  You probably get better lighting if you waited to take this in late afternoon.</td>', 'I like the repeating elements going away from my eye ... into infinity (well suggested).  I also like the bold colors here.  My only problem is the lighting, too harsh.  You probably get better lighting if you waited to take this in late afternoon.', '2005-05-16 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388960, 176021, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is a fine example of framing within a frame.  The ''v'' of the tree really focuses your viewer to look at your beautiful subject.  Good job!</td>', 'This is a fine example of framing within a frame.  The ''v'' of the tree really focuses your viewer to look at your beautiful subject.  Good job!', '2005-05-16 14:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388962, 175705, 12962, '<td valign="top">Filling the frame with repeating elements and lots of triangles makes a good graphical image!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Filling the frame with repeating elements and lots of triangles makes a good graphical image!  Congratulations!', '2005-05-16 14:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388966, 176478, 12962, '<td valign="top">Makes me chuckle.  The triangle repeats are great too.  Inclusion of the photographer may have not been the best choice here, but hey, it is good for scale.</td>', 'Makes me chuckle.  The triangle repeats are great too.  Inclusion of the photographer may have not been the best choice here, but hey, it is good for scale.', '2005-05-16 14:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388970, 175439, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow, lots of triangles here!  I love the composition and it''s just bad that this doesn''t look as good as when I opened it in Photoshop (where the blues and the greens are more vivid than here).</td>', 'Wow, lots of triangles here!  I love the composition and it''s just bad that this doesn''t look as good as when I opened it in Photoshop (where the blues and the greens are more vivid than here).', '2005-05-16 14:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388973, 175885, 34396, '<td valign="top">Although the photograph does contain a triangle, it doesn''t jump out at me as a key element.  I can''t tell what the "frame"? is around the photograph, but it is very distracting.  It almost looks like an empty slide frame held in front of the lens while shooting.  The background is a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Although the photograph does contain a triangle, it doesn''t jump out at me as a key element.  I can''t tell what the "frame"? is around the photograph, but it is very distracting.  It almost looks like an empty slide frame held in front of the lens while shooting.  The background is a bit overexposed.', '2005-05-16 14:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388977, 175526, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good framing, lots of triangles.  The only problem in my humble opinion is, my eye doesn''t know what to look at whether the triangles in the front or the triangle at the back.  But it''s a fine take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good framing, lots of triangles.  The only problem in my humble opinion is, my eye doesn''t know what to look at whether the triangles in the front or the triangle at the back.  But it''s a fine take on the challenge.', '2005-05-16 14:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388986, 176284, 12962, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge!  Some of the fingers and part of the face and neck of the subject are blown out though - the eyes go to the blown out parts first then are locked there.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge!  Some of the fingers and part of the face and neck of the subject are blown out though - the eyes go to the blown out parts first then are locked there.', '2005-05-16 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388998, 176188, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Such cute fuzzy creatures, eh?  Tweaking of the levels to punch the color more would do right side  rather than the center would render this more dynamic.  Good portrait though.</td>', 'Wow!  Such cute fuzzy creatures, eh?  Tweaking of the levels to punch the color more would do right side  rather than the center would render this more dynamic.  Good portrait though.', '2005-05-16 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389001, 176512, 34396, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture for the Triangle challenge.  The "sepiatone"? dramaticizes the feel of "Relic" to me.  I can feel the rust in this photo.  In my top 5.</td>', 'Excellent capture for the Triangle challenge.  The "sepiatone"? dramaticizes the feel of "Relic" to me.  I can feel the rust in this photo.  In my top 5.', '2005-05-16 14:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389002, 176452, 34396, '<td valign="top">Love the crisp focus on this shot.  The falcon is staring at you as if you had it''s dinner perched on your lens.  Colors are wonderful.  One of my top 5!</td>', 'Love the crisp focus on this shot.  The falcon is staring at you as if you had it''s dinner perched on your lens.  Colors are wonderful.  One of my top 5!', '2005-05-16 14:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389007, 176486, 34396, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo!  I love the colors and shadows.  Bumping up. In my top 5.</td>', 'Fascinating photo!  I love the colors and shadows.  Bumping up. In my top 5.', '2005-05-16 14:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389008, 175589, 34396, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  Very crisp, nice colors.  In my top 5.</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  Very crisp, nice colors.  In my top 5.', '2005-05-16 14:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389009, 175130, 12962, '<td valign="top">Too bad you can''t clone the faint c-structure at the back.  Even if it just a small part of the background, it is a little bit distracting.  I love the lighting here though.  Certainly a wonderful take of the challenge.  Lots of triangles to look at!</td>', 'Too bad you can''t clone the faint c-structure at the back.  Even if it just a small part of the background, it is a little bit distracting.  I love the lighting here though.  Certainly a wonderful take of the challenge.  Lots of triangles to look at!', '2005-05-16 14:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389047, 176593, 12962, '<td valign="top">A good example of visual echoing (and synchronized swimming).  It''s a good catch and quick reaction time in your part.  BTW, if you have a chance to do this again, do this experiment:  move around (quickly or you might lose them) to make them more diagonal (more deeply slanted), then focus on the first duck with the second duck at the back a little bit out of focus - probably use a lower aperture number to make the depth of field shallower.  You will find the second unfocused duck like an echo.</td>', 'A good example of visual echoing (and synchronized swimming).  It''s a good catch and quick reaction time in your part.  BTW, if you have a chance to do this again, do this experiment:  move around (quickly or you might lose them) to make them more diagonal (more deeply slanted), then focus on the first duck with the second duck at the back a little bit out of focus - probably use a lower aperture number to make the depth of field shallower.  You will find the second unfocused duck like an echo.', '2005-05-16 14:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389056, 174958, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the distortion.  Of course the emphasis of the red against the blue is beautiful too.  But I don''t know why you''ve added the white strip on the right of the frame.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the distortion.  Of course the emphasis of the red against the blue is beautiful too.  But I don''t know why you''ve added the white strip on the right of the frame.', '2005-05-16 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389061, 176090, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is surreal ... like I''m in the edge of my sanity kind of thing.  Love it!</td>', 'This is surreal ... like I''m in the edge of my sanity kind of thing.  Love it!', '2005-05-16 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389062, 176237, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nature''s geometry as its best and you''ve captured it so well.</td>', 'Nature''s geometry as its best and you''ve captured it so well.', '2005-05-16 14:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389066, 174727, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love th overexposed background, so delicious and sinful just even to look at.</td>', 'This is great!  I love th overexposed background, so delicious and sinful just even to look at.', '2005-05-16 14:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389077, 175400, 12962, '<td valign="top">I would lighten this (curves or levels) a little bit more to make the colors of the wood more vivid as the grain of the wood is beautiful as well as your side lighting.</td>', 'I would lighten this (curves or levels) a little bit more to make the colors of the wood more vivid as the grain of the wood is beautiful as well as your side lighting.', '2005-05-16 14:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
