(1389260, 176055, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, and I''m amazed that you were able to get them to pose like this!  Unfortunately, the tone and sharpness of the shot have somewhat of a polaroid instant-photo feel to it, though.</td>', 'This is a great idea, and I''m amazed that you were able to get them to pose like this!  Unfortunately, the tone and sharpness of the shot have somewhat of a polaroid instant-photo feel to it, though.', '2005-05-16 15:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389264, 176306, 33947, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic macro and very creative. Sharp as a tack, great color. 10<br/> <br/>Second pass...I LOVE IT!!! If I could give more than a 10, I would.</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic macro and very creative. Sharp as a tack, great color. 10 Second pass...I LOVE IT!!! If I could give more than a 10, I would.', '2005-05-16 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
