(1389582, 174079, 7743, '<td valign="top">Yes the toast is triangular, however the challenge connection to me is the placement of the objects within your composition.  The eye is led from the toast to the coffee to the two jars and back to the toast, forming a triangle.  Very good use of negative space as well.  The focus seems a little soft and the image could possibly use a little more contrast. 7</td>', 'Yes the toast is triangular, however the challenge connection to me is the placement of the objects within your composition.  The eye is led from the toast to the coffee to the two jars and back to the toast, forming a triangle.  Very good use of negative space as well.  The focus seems a little soft and the image could possibly use a little more contrast. 7', '2005-05-16 17:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389597, 174194, 18868, '<td valign="top">Great idea marred by technical problems -- focus is a little soft, the image could use a bit more sharpening for web viewing, and the contrast could be increased (but only if the lighting were softer in the original image)</td>', 'Great idea marred by technical problems -- focus is a little soft, the image could use a bit more sharpening for web viewing, and the contrast could be increased (but only if the lighting were softer in the original image)', '2005-05-16 18:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
