(1389639, 174134, 37885, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this bigger. Lovely shape, though perhaps stretching a point for the ''triangle'' theme.</td>', 'I''d like to see this bigger. Lovely shape, though perhaps stretching a point for the ''triangle'' theme.', '2005-05-16 18:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389647, 174929, 37885, '<td valign="top">Over-sharpened, weird colour and too much contrast, and I don''t like the border much. Apart from that, not bad. I do like the wide shape and the overall idea.</td>', 'Over-sharpened, weird colour and too much contrast, and I don''t like the border much. Apart from that, not bad. I do like the wide shape and the overall idea.', '2005-05-16 18:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389655, 175144, 37885, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharp detail on the near end. I think including the packet makes it look too much like an advertising shot, but the composition and technique are A+.</td>', 'Lovely sharp detail on the near end. I think including the packet makes it look too much like an advertising shot, but the composition and technique are A+.', '2005-05-16 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389660, 175182, 37885, '<td valign="top">It''s got that auto-white-balance-shot-against-grass look, i.e. it''s pink. Zooming in or cropping would make the picture more interesting. I like the way the theme''s been interpreted.</td>', 'It''s got that auto-white-balance-shot-against-grass look, i.e. it''s pink. Zooming in or cropping would make the picture more interesting. I like the way the theme''s been interpreted.', '2005-05-16 18:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389666, 176487, 37885, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour, subject and composition. My only tiny reservation is the loss of detail in the clouds, but that would be hard to avoid without some illicit photoshopping. Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Lovely colour, subject and composition. My only tiny reservation is the loss of detail in the clouds, but that would be hard to avoid without some illicit photoshopping. Very nice indeed.', '2005-05-16 18:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389668, 176435, 3102, '<td valign="top">If you were going to shoehorn this into the challenge with the border, you could have at least focused the horse... :P</td>', 'If you were going to shoehorn this into the challenge with the border, you could have at least focused the horse... :P', '2005-05-16 18:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389669, 176196, 37885, '<td valign="top">How odd. Made me smile.</td>', 'How odd. Made me smile.', '2005-05-16 18:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389676, 175884, 37885, '<td valign="top">Odd composition; I can''t decide whether I like it or not. Wider angle would make it more dramatic. Great, simple colours.</td>', 'Odd composition; I can''t decide whether I like it or not. Wider angle would make it more dramatic. Great, simple colours.', '2005-05-16 18:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389681, 176021, 37885, '<td valign="top">Sweet, but slightly eerie. Monochrome was a good choice.</td>', 'Sweet, but slightly eerie. Monochrome was a good choice.', '2005-05-16 18:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389686, 176349, 37885, '<td valign="top">Odd. Might have been better in black &amp; white, for a Cartier-Bresson kind of feel. But I like it.</td>', 'Odd. Might have been better in black & white, for a Cartier-Bresson kind of feel. But I like it.', '2005-05-16 18:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389689, 176395, 37885, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, though it needs some colour correction.</td>', 'Lovely shot, though it needs some colour correction.', '2005-05-16 18:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389693, 176306, 37885, '<td valign="top">Bold, colourful and cheeky. I want to see this printed out wall-size.</td>', 'Bold, colourful and cheeky. I want to see this printed out wall-size.', '2005-05-16 18:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389697, 175197, 37885, '<td valign="top">Inspiration a bit low? Nice perspective, but I don''t think you''ve exploited it fully.</td>', 'Inspiration a bit low? Nice perspective, but I don''t think you''ve exploited it fully.', '2005-05-16 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389700, 174698, 37885, '<td valign="top">Magic.</td>', 'Magic.', '2005-05-16 18:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389701, 176414, 37885, '<td valign="top">Nice crop.</td>', 'Nice crop.', '2005-05-16 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389704, 176514, 37885, '<td valign="top">Just slightly off 45 degrees, which bothers me. Nice texture and colour.</td>', 'Just slightly off 45 degrees, which bothers me. Nice texture and colour.', '2005-05-16 18:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389707, 174560, 37885, '<td valign="top">Classic. Practically perfect.</td>', 'Classic. Practically perfect.', '2005-05-16 18:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389709, 175171, 37885, '<td valign="top">the plane''s just too small to be an effective element in the composition. Good triangles, though.</td>', 'the plane''s just too small to be an effective element in the composition. Good triangles, though.', '2005-05-16 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389712, 175851, 37885, '<td valign="top">Timing!</td>', 'Timing!', '2005-05-16 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389715, 176409, 37885, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen two others of billiard balls, and this is the best by far. It''s the angle. I love the white ball hiding in the corner.</td>', 'I''ve seen two others of billiard balls, and this is the best by far. It''s the angle. I love the white ball hiding in the corner.', '2005-05-16 18:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389720, 175359, 37885, '<td valign="top">Very finely executed.</td>', 'Very finely executed.', '2005-05-16 18:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389721, 175887, 37885, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the image quality lets it down.</td>', 'Nice picture, but the image quality lets it down.', '2005-05-16 18:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389723, 176188, 37885, '<td valign="top">I want one.</td>', 'I want one.', '2005-05-16 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389729, 175434, 37885, '<td valign="top">Can''t argue with that. Excellent image.</td>', 'Can''t argue with that. Excellent image.', '2005-05-16 18:54:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1389730, 175589, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the colours.</td>', 'Very nice! Love the colours.', '2005-05-16 18:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389732, 176357, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2005-05-16 18:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389768, 175902, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice find but the clouds are all blown out, pure white with no details</td>', 'Nice find but the clouds are all blown out, pure white with no details', '2005-05-16 19:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389770, 174825, 30392, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but it''s out of focus</td>', 'Sorry, but it''s out of focus', '2005-05-16 19:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389773, 174711, 30392, '<td valign="top">Great night shot, what a forbidding building! It would have been good to try a hue shift from dirty orange to blue</td>', 'Great night shot, what a forbidding building! It would have been good to try a hue shift from dirty orange to blue', '2005-05-16 19:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389778, 176368, 30392, '<td valign="top">this would have been better with another light source, the shadows are a bit strong as it is</td>', 'this would have been better with another light source, the shadows are a bit strong as it is', '2005-05-16 19:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389780, 176546, 30392, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF, good composition and nice subject ;)</td>', 'Excellent DOF, good composition and nice subject ;)', '2005-05-16 19:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389781, 175486, 30392, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the overexposure doesn''t work for me</td>', 'Sorry, the overexposure doesn''t work for me', '2005-05-16 19:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389783, 174965, 30392, '<td valign="top">Is this the mike in singapore? that looks like a durian fruit? Nice photo anyway, good composition but a bit  washed out</td>', 'Is this the mike in singapore? that looks like a durian fruit? Nice photo anyway, good composition but a bit  washed out', '2005-05-16 19:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389787, 176426, 30392, '<td valign="top">Good shot! I wanted to do something similar.  I like the grey tones, maybe a bit more black would have improved it</td>', 'Good shot! I wanted to do something similar.  I like the grey tones, maybe a bit more black would have improved it', '2005-05-16 19:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389791, 176519, 36437, '<td valign="top">Lovely image...i like it...good luke!</td>', 'Lovely image...i like it...good luke!', '2005-05-16 19:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389794, 175065, 30392, '<td valign="top">Very impressive shot, but it seems overexposed too me (maybe it''s meant to be!) and it would be a lot better if rotated counter clockwise by 2 or 3 deg! 7</td>', 'Very impressive shot, but it seems overexposed too me (maybe it''s meant to be!) and it would be a lot better if rotated counter clockwise by 2 or 3 deg! 7', '2005-05-16 19:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389795, 175103, 36437, '<td valign="top">Wow beautyfull!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Wow beautyfull!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2005-05-16 19:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389799, 174901, 30392, '<td valign="top">Really cool point of view, very creative, nice blue sky too</td>', 'Really cool point of view, very creative, nice blue sky too', '2005-05-16 19:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389800, 176426, 31606, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  You have thought "outside the box"  for that I score high.  On technical merit you also have done a marvelous job.</td>', 'Nice idea.  You have thought "outside the box"  for that I score high.  On technical merit you also have done a marvelous job.', '2005-05-16 19:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389805, 176559, 30392, '<td valign="top">lol, good idea and nice execution, I like the crazy angle. A tad more DOF would have helped as parts of te pic are slightly out of focus</td>', 'lol, good idea and nice execution, I like the crazy angle. A tad more DOF would have helped as parts of te pic are slightly out of focus', '2005-05-16 19:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389807, 175526, 30392, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual point of view. It looks like it needs rotating to the right</td>', 'I like the unusual point of view. It looks like it needs rotating to the right', '2005-05-16 19:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389817, 176452, 31606, '<td valign="top">Total amazment.  Technically job well done.  What a beautiful capture.  You should win a ribbon with this one.  One of my top 3.  10 from me and a new favorite.</td>', 'Total amazment.  Technically job well done.  What a beautiful capture.  You should win a ribbon with this one.  One of my top 3.  10 from me and a new favorite.', '2005-05-16 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389819, 175634, 31606, '<td valign="top">One of my top three.  The only things that bother me are the crop on the right and the left.  Cutting off the boats is usually not a good thing.  I love the border and the tones in this image.  One of my top three. 10<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-18 07:07:08.</i></td>', 'One of my top three.  The only things that bother me are the crop on the right and the left.  Cutting off the boats is usually not a good thing.  I love the border and the tones in this image.  One of my top three. 10', '2005-05-16 19:47:51.000000', '2005-05-18 08:07:08.000000', 1),
(1389820, 175711, 31606, '<td valign="top">Nice calming image.  One of my top 3. 10 from me.</td>', 'Nice calming image.  One of my top 3. 10 from me.', '2005-05-16 19:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389825, 176092, 30392, '<td valign="top">Wow, very impressive! It looks like it could do with a bit of sharpening. Also, cropping some of the right and rotating slightly to the left would make the symmetry work better</td>', 'Wow, very impressive! It looks like it could do with a bit of sharpening. Also, cropping some of the right and rotating slightly to the left would make the symmetry work better', '2005-05-16 19:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389828, 175572, 34904, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the saturation.  I think the cropping is just about right.  Cropping it looser would cause you to lose your subject, cropping it tighter would eliminate too much scenerie.</td>', 'I like the colors and the saturation.  I think the cropping is just about right.  Cropping it looser would cause you to lose your subject, cropping it tighter would eliminate too much scenerie.', '2005-05-16 19:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389830, 176497, 34904, '<td valign="top">Good cropping.  I like the lighting effect and the reflection of the blue sky in the ornament adds something.</td>', 'Good cropping.  I like the lighting effect and the reflection of the blue sky in the ornament adds something.', '2005-05-16 19:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389835, 176306, 34904, '<td valign="top">I like the color combination, but as a Michigan person would have preferred a blue jacket &lt;grin&gt;.  It may have looked better if the sweater knitting would have lined up with the zipper pull.</td>', 'I like the color combination, but as a Michigan person would have preferred a blue jacket <grin>.  It may have looked better if the sweater knitting would have lined up with the zipper pull.', '2005-05-16 19:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389836, 176556, 30392, '<td valign="top">wow, I love this pic, it makes me feel dizzy! The weird angle creates a feeling of vertigo. Should be a ribbon! A 10 from me and a new fav too</td>', 'wow, I love this pic, it makes me feel dizzy! The weird angle creates a feeling of vertigo. Should be a ribbon! A 10 from me and a new fav too', '2005-05-16 19:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389838, 176414, 34904, '<td valign="top">It showed good imagination to crop the tips of the windmill blades to form triangles.  I think the colors are perfect.</td>', 'It showed good imagination to crop the tips of the windmill blades to form triangles.  I think the colors are perfect.', '2005-05-16 20:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389840, 174292, 34904, '<td valign="top">Good colors, good background.  Definately meets the challenge.  I would have liked to have seen a little more black at the top of the chip tops.</td>', 'Good colors, good background.  Definately meets the challenge.  I would have liked to have seen a little more black at the top of the chip tops.', '2005-05-16 20:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389844, 175434, 34904, '<td valign="top">I like the saturation and changing to to black and white.  It looks like you hit the nail on the head.</td>', 'I like the saturation and changing to to black and white.  It looks like you hit the nail on the head.', '2005-05-16 20:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389847, 175144, 34904, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge.  I think it may look better of the colors were a bit softer.</td>', 'It meets the challenge.  I think it may look better of the colors were a bit softer.', '2005-05-16 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389849, 175497, 34904, '<td valign="top">I would like to know how you did it when the judging is over.  It''s brilliant that the shadow of the triangle and the triangle make a new triangle.  I would like to see part of a plane or something to show that this was near an airport.  I could be way off.....</td>', 'I would like to know how you did it when the judging is over.  It''s brilliant that the shadow of the triangle and the triangle make a new triangle.  I would like to see part of a plane or something to show that this was near an airport.  I could be way off.....', '2005-05-16 20:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389850, 176518, 34904, '<td valign="top">I marked it down because I couldn''t find the triangles.  Other than that, it looks like a good spring time photo.</td>', 'I marked it down because I couldn''t find the triangles.  Other than that, it looks like a good spring time photo.', '2005-05-16 20:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389852, 176385, 34904, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this met the challenge.  You have 3 points (the birds) but to get a triangle you need some lines to connect them together.  <br/> <br/>They are too much in a line to let your imagination complete the triangle.</td>', 'I don''t think this met the challenge.  You have 3 points (the birds) but to get a triangle you need some lines to connect them together.   They are too much in a line to let your imagination complete the triangle.', '2005-05-16 20:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389855, 176348, 34904, '<td valign="top">Black and white works well for this picture.  I think there is too much unused space at the top.  The triangles are there, but they are too small.</td>', 'Black and white works well for this picture.  I think there is too much unused space at the top.  The triangles are there, but they are too small.', '2005-05-16 20:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389868, 175242, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the abstract quality.  -8</td>', 'I like the composition and the abstract quality.  -8', '2005-05-16 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389869, 174148, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work.  -8</td>', 'Good work.  -8', '2005-05-16 20:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389870, 176486, 24642, '<td valign="top">Massive metal.  -9</td>', 'Massive metal.  -9', '2005-05-16 20:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389872, 175748, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very strange but appealing.  -7</td>', 'Very strange but appealing.  -7', '2005-05-16 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389876, 176385, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalist pic, very creative, well done</td>', 'Nice minimalist pic, very creative, well done', '2005-05-16 20:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389880, 175007, 30392, '<td valign="top">I like the rich colors and the vibrant sky, I wish there was more of the left side of the "triangle " visible</td>', 'I like the rich colors and the vibrant sky, I wish there was more of the left side of the "triangle " visible', '2005-05-16 20:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389881, 176090, 35786, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo but I feel like you should have cropped the horizon line off.</td>', 'I really like this photo but I feel like you should have cropped the horizon line off.', '2005-05-16 20:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389926, 174906, 37320, '<td valign="top">What a convenient time to be in Cairo!</td>', 'What a convenient time to be in Cairo!', '2005-05-16 21:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389959, 176090, 37875, '<td valign="top">I gotta say..i love this photograph.  It''s so haunting and surreal, and the composition is cool too.  Not sure how it holds up for the criteria of "triangles" though, with the triangle as the dominant theme.</td>', 'I gotta say..i love this photograph.  It''s so haunting and surreal, and the composition is cool too.  Not sure how it holds up for the criteria of "triangles" though, with the triangle as the dominant theme.', '2005-05-16 21:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389966, 176615, 37875, '<td valign="top">I like how the mhendi swirls contrast against the triangle.</td>', 'I like how the mhendi swirls contrast against the triangle.', '2005-05-16 21:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389971, 174945, 37875, '<td valign="top">love the lighting!</td>', 'love the lighting!', '2005-05-16 21:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389983, 174194, 37875, '<td valign="top">I like the whimsy of this composition...like looking down and reading "triangle" spelled out in your alphabet soup!</td>', 'I like the whimsy of this composition...like looking down and reading "triangle" spelled out in your alphabet soup!', '2005-05-16 21:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389993, 176284, 37875, '<td valign="top">I''m not thrilled by the composition here..the triangle gets lost with the introduction of the other fingers, and the mouth does not add much to the image for me.</td>', 'I''m not thrilled by the composition here..the triangle gets lost with the introduction of the other fingers, and the mouth does not add much to the image for me.', '2005-05-16 21:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390005, 176392, 37875, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you combine the softness of the organic with something I tend to think of as hard and rigid.  This photo is growing on me!</td>', 'Interesting how you combine the softness of the organic with something I tend to think of as hard and rigid.  This photo is growing on me!', '2005-05-16 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390007, 176055, 37875, '<td valign="top">A fun concept, but the photo seems really washed out and somewhat out of focus.</td>', 'A fun concept, but the photo seems really washed out and somewhat out of focus.', '2005-05-16 21:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390010, 175414, 37875, '<td valign="top">Nice image, and I enjoy the humor!</td>', 'Nice image, and I enjoy the humor!', '2005-05-16 21:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390019, 174447, 37875, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the colors, the simplicity of this.</td>', 'I like the composition, the colors, the simplicity of this.', '2005-05-16 21:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390032, 175448, 37875, '<td valign="top">Love this!  The color, the unexpectedness of the composition, the softness of a picture of triangles.</td>', 'Love this!  The color, the unexpectedness of the composition, the softness of a picture of triangles.', '2005-05-16 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390037, 176168, 37875, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and contrast of colors as well as wood against shadow.</td>', 'Like the composition and contrast of colors as well as wood against shadow.', '2005-05-16 21:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390044, 176234, 37875, '<td valign="top">Like the wheels and pieces, but the black &amp; white dulls the picture down so that it becomes disinteresting to me.</td>', 'Like the wheels and pieces, but the black & white dulls the picture down so that it becomes disinteresting to me.', '2005-05-16 22:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390045, 176306, 37875, '<td valign="top">Unexpected, colorful, interesting composition.</td>', 'Unexpected, colorful, interesting composition.', '2005-05-16 22:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390048, 175469, 37875, '<td valign="top">Picture turned out grainy, to the point of distorting the child''s face.</td>', 'Picture turned out grainy, to the point of distorting the child''s face.', '2005-05-16 22:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390052, 174742, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice colors and it meets the challenge but I''d like it better with more depth of field so that all three blossoms were in focus</td>', 'nice colors and it meets the challenge but I''d like it better with more depth of field so that all three blossoms were in focus', '2005-05-16 22:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390053, 176547, 37875, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, the composition, how the water drop creates its own triangle.  Clear, crisp image, too.  Very nice and interesting.</td>', 'Like the colors, the composition, how the water drop creates its own triangle.  Clear, crisp image, too.  Very nice and interesting.', '2005-05-16 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390055, 176348, 37875, '<td valign="top">Egad!  It IS a robot!  Those triangle robots are taking over the world!  I like the sense of humor in this, but the proportion of open sky seems to diminish the photo to me.</td>', 'Egad!  It IS a robot!  Those triangle robots are taking over the world!  I like the sense of humor in this, but the proportion of open sky seems to diminish the photo to me.', '2005-05-16 22:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390058, 176486, 37875, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Love the colors and the contrasts, with the curves and angles, steel and water.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Love the colors and the contrasts, with the curves and angles, steel and water.', '2005-05-16 22:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390060, 174560, 37875, '<td valign="top">Fun photo...like it in the black &amp; white</td>', 'Fun photo...like it in the black & white', '2005-05-16 22:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390061, 175550, 37875, '<td valign="top">Visually interesting and energetic.</td>', 'Visually interesting and energetic.', '2005-05-16 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390068, 175705, 37875, '<td valign="top">This one is growing on me!  Like the umbrellas as a touch of the unexpected.</td>', 'This one is growing on me!  Like the umbrellas as a touch of the unexpected.', '2005-05-16 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390072, 175144, 35827, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite chocolate! oh yeah, love the shot too.</td>', 'this is my favorite chocolate! oh yeah, love the shot too.', '2005-05-16 22:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390074, 175263, 35827, '<td valign="top">the best card photo i''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'the best card photo i''ve seen in this challenge.', '2005-05-16 22:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390075, 175892, 37875, '<td valign="top">I kind of like this..how the triangle emerges simply through the play of light.  Beautiful blue.</td>', 'I kind of like this..how the triangle emerges simply through the play of light.  Beautiful blue.', '2005-05-16 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390080, 176256, 37875, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture...how the clothes, sky and person create their own triangles.  <br/></td>', 'Interesting picture...how the clothes, sky and person create their own triangles.  ', '2005-05-16 22:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
