(1390763, 176723, 27440, '<td valign="top">Over neatimaged or something?</td>', 'Over neatimaged or something?', '2005-05-17 05:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390766, 176305, 27440, '<td valign="top">The lighting is done badly. No dimentions shown. There is no shadow to paint with. And there is this strong light coming from behind that is changing the colour intensity - bad thing to do. The angle is so strait forward - uninteresting. It seems so pale and flat.  There is a triangle thogh. Try to make the image more interesting by using light and shadow to your favour.  Using shape is more difficult. Keep trying  I give you a 4 I guess . But you could have easily bumped it up a lot higher</td>', 'The lighting is done badly. No dimentions shown. There is no shadow to paint with. And there is this strong light coming from behind that is changing the colour intensity - bad thing to do. The angle is so strait forward - uninteresting. It seems so pale and flat.  There is a triangle thogh. Try to make the image more interesting by using light and shadow to your favour.  Using shape is more difficult. Keep trying  I give you a 4 I guess . But you could have easily bumped it up a lot higher', '2005-05-17 06:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390768, 175235, 27440, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the opposing colours and opposing  depths.</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the opposing colours and opposing  depths.', '2005-05-17 06:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390769, 176567, 27440, '<td valign="top">My god it must have hurt to cut your arm off :P I like the yellow-ish tint.  Tell me what''s this mark in the bottom right hand corner doing there huh?  To bad the triagnle doesn''t close up. It''s  interesting I give you that/. I don''t like the way the light spreads on the background. On the other hand there could be little you could have done about it.</td>', 'My god it must have hurt to cut your arm off :P I like the yellow-ish tint.  Tell me what''s this mark in the bottom right hand corner doing there huh?  To bad the triagnle doesn''t close up. It''s  interesting I give you that/. I don''t like the way the light spreads on the background. On the other hand there could be little you could have done about it.', '2005-05-17 06:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390772, 175711, 27440, '<td valign="top">To much watter on the bottom. You could have raised the whole thing up. It feels cramped.  But the water colours and texture make up for it. 7.</td>', 'To much watter on the bottom. You could have raised the whole thing up. It feels cramped.  But the water colours and texture make up for it. 7.', '2005-05-17 06:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390773, 174063, 27440, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but technicaly it''s a disaster.  It''s a 5.</td>', 'Interesting idea but technicaly it''s a disaster.  It''s a 5.', '2005-05-17 06:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390774, 176023, 27440, '<td valign="top">Now this is drawing a lot of attention. I am more than sure you will geta ribbon. It''s a unique image.  You don''t see such things so often.  A grat capture.  Tell me was it done by acciden''t or did you imagine it that way and simply shot it ?   Anyway it''s really interesting.   I give it a 10.</td>', 'Now this is drawing a lot of attention. I am more than sure you will geta ribbon. It''s a unique image.  You don''t see such things so often.  A grat capture.  Tell me was it done by acciden''t or did you imagine it that way and simply shot it ?   Anyway it''s really interesting.   I give it a 10.', '2005-05-17 06:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390776, 176519, 27440, '<td valign="top">Hope you don''t get marked down for the blown out white parts. I thing they work in this image and that they are for a purpose. It''s a 9. I would give it a 10 if the eye was so damn crispy focus.</td>', 'Hope you don''t get marked down for the blown out white parts. I thing they work in this image and that they are for a purpose. It''s a 9. I would give it a 10 if the eye was so damn crispy focus.', '2005-05-17 06:13:23.000000', NULL, 1);
