(1392013, 176486, 32848, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this picture seemed to have too much black in it, so I looked at it a bit longer.  It grew on me and I do like the picture a lot now, it must the a combination of colour, shape and contrast.  Funny isn''t it, how you can change your mind like that?</td>', 'At first glance, this picture seemed to have too much black in it, so I looked at it a bit longer.  It grew on me and I do like the picture a lot now, it must the a combination of colour, shape and contrast.  Funny isn''t it, how you can change your mind like that?', '2005-05-17 15:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392014, 176478, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  I would have loved to see your arms outstretched around the church.</td>', 'Very funny.  I would have loved to see your arms outstretched around the church.', '2005-05-17 15:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
