(1392070, 176024, 34247, '<td valign="top">lots of reflective surfaces controlled well with the lighting choice. I like the suggestions of triangular shapes not only with the candles but also in the foil background. 9</td>', 'lots of reflective surfaces controlled well with the lighting choice. I like the suggestions of triangular shapes not only with the candles but also in the foil background. 9', '2005-05-17 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392072, 176237, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the color tones, texture and general composition here. 9</td>', 'i like the color tones, texture and general composition here. 9', '2005-05-17 16:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392075, 175373, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice, aged look with the rusty tones. would be a 10 for me in the challenge but for the flash of hot tones on the lower right. as it is, i think it merits a 9. but it''s tempting for me to bump it, just because i like the composition and ideas very much.</td>', 'nice, aged look with the rusty tones. would be a 10 for me in the challenge but for the flash of hot tones on the lower right. as it is, i think it merits a 9. but it''s tempting for me to bump it, just because i like the composition and ideas very much.', '2005-05-17 16:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392076, 175933, 3746, '<td valign="top">far too much neatimage here</td>', 'far too much neatimage here', '2005-05-17 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392078, 176013, 34247, '<td valign="top">beautiful color tones, and i like the reflected clouds a lot. i also appreciate how there are both little and big, simple and more complex triangular shapes here, reflective of the vision for the shot. 9</td>', 'beautiful color tones, and i like the reflected clouds a lot. i also appreciate how there are both little and big, simple and more complex triangular shapes here, reflective of the vision for the shot. 9', '2005-05-17 16:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392079, 176289, 34247, '<td valign="top">simple, effective composition. i particularly like the textures on the surfaces and the very nicely toned colors and light/shadows. 10</td>', 'simple, effective composition. i particularly like the textures on the surfaces and the very nicely toned colors and light/shadows. 10', '2005-05-17 16:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392083, 175474, 34247, '<td valign="top">very nice perspective/composition, right on title that adds much to the image. Only complaint would be the slightly hotter tones at the bottom center of the image. I know it''s basic edit and not much can be done in the context of the challenge, but i feel this would be more effective with a bit of a burn after the challenge. 9</td>', 'very nice perspective/composition, right on title that adds much to the image. Only complaint would be the slightly hotter tones at the bottom center of the image. I know it''s basic edit and not much can be done in the context of the challenge, but i feel this would be more effective with a bit of a burn after the challenge. 9', '2005-05-17 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392086, 176456, 34247, '<td valign="top">great crop and eye for the small detail. Like the blown out background, but find the dark spot on the left upper corner a small distraction. 9</td>', 'great crop and eye for the small detail. Like the blown out background, but find the dark spot on the left upper corner a small distraction. 9', '2005-05-17 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392088, 176519, 34247, '<td valign="top">cute baby, nice lighting choice, would wish to see a more contrasted eye region, nicely executed idea to fit the challenge. 9</td>', 'cute baby, nice lighting choice, would wish to see a more contrasted eye region, nicely executed idea to fit the challenge. 9', '2005-05-17 16:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392091, 176105, 34247, '<td valign="top">Great use of crop, nice black and white application. nice reading of the challenge theme :). As a photo separate from the context of this challenge, I feel this could use more oomph factor, and spot edits could do that. In the context of this challenge and the basic edit limitations, I''m rating this an 8 for the nice crop usage alone. bumping to 9 on second look.</td>', 'Great use of crop, nice black and white application. nice reading of the challenge theme :). As a photo separate from the context of this challenge, I feel this could use more oomph factor, and spot edits could do that. In the context of this challenge and the basic edit limitations, I''m rating this an 8 for the nice crop usage alone. bumping to 9 on second look.', '2005-05-17 16:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392098, 175103, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice macro, love the colors. can''t say more than wow for this shot. 10</td>', 'nice macro, love the colors. can''t say more than wow for this shot. 10', '2005-05-17 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392101, 175294, 34247, '<td valign="top">got ya. nice idea, evocative shot. the purplish glow in various elements of the image, however, doesn''t quite work for me. but nice idea and interpretation. 7</td>', 'got ya. nice idea, evocative shot. the purplish glow in various elements of the image, however, doesn''t quite work for me. but nice idea and interpretation. 7', '2005-05-17 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392104, 175144, 34247, '<td valign="top">would make a great ad for the product. like the texture on the break in the foreground, as well as the fluid-like nature of the foil. 9</td>', 'would make a great ad for the product. like the texture on the break in the foreground, as well as the fluid-like nature of the foil. 9', '2005-05-17 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392107, 175912, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice use of repetition, and one of the better perspectives for repeated triangles in the challenge. i usually like grain in an image, but for this i feel a softer look would be more effective. 9</td>', 'nice use of repetition, and one of the better perspectives for repeated triangles in the challenge. i usually like grain in an image, but for this i feel a softer look would be more effective. 9', '2005-05-17 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392112, 176280, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the view here, but the slightly skewed horizontal line isn''t working as well for me. another nitpick would be the high contrast value. 9.</td>', 'i like the view here, but the slightly skewed horizontal line isn''t working as well for me. another nitpick would be the high contrast value. 9.', '2005-05-17 16:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392115, 176740, 34247, '<td valign="top">great compositional idea and angling, but i feel there''s a bit too much light here for this image to be "perfect." darker, moodier tones might be more effective for me. 9</td>', 'great compositional idea and angling, but i feel there''s a bit too much light here for this image to be "perfect." darker, moodier tones might be more effective for me. 9', '2005-05-17 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
