(1392217, 176479, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows, and on close inspection, I see that this collection of triangles is composed of playing cards. Nice setup. The lighting and background however, are dull, which detracts from the photo''s appeal for me.</td>', 'Nice shadows, and on close inspection, I see that this collection of triangles is composed of playing cards. Nice setup. The lighting and background however, are dull, which detracts from the photo''s appeal for me.', '2005-05-17 17:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392227, 176363, 3419, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - the thumbnail for this photo certainly doesn''t do it justice. Very nice lighting to get such clean looking glass. I wish the background was different however. The color and texture just don''t appeal to me. And I wish the text on the lid was not upside down.</td>', 'Hmmm - the thumbnail for this photo certainly doesn''t do it justice. Very nice lighting to get such clean looking glass. I wish the background was different however. The color and texture just don''t appeal to me. And I wish the text on the lid was not upside down.', '2005-05-17 17:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392238, 176029, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good lighting - nice and even - no blowouts or dark shadows. Nice composition - the light is hanging vertical, and interesting symmetrical angling of the eaves from top to bottom (hope that makes sense to you?). Would I hang this on my wall? Probably not....</td>', 'Good lighting - nice and even - no blowouts or dark shadows. Nice composition - the light is hanging vertical, and interesting symmetrical angling of the eaves from top to bottom (hope that makes sense to you?). Would I hang this on my wall? Probably not....', '2005-05-17 17:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392244, 175991, 3419, '<td valign="top">My eye is drawn more to the toothbrushes than to the triangle part of the stand. However, nice colors, interesting subject matter.</td>', 'My eye is drawn more to the toothbrushes than to the triangle part of the stand. However, nice colors, interesting subject matter.', '2005-05-17 17:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392249, 176314, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for an abstract. Good lighting and composition, however it looks soft to me, like the low-light focus could be improved. To make this a nice photo to me, the edges of your triangle must be sharp.</td>', 'Nice subject for an abstract. Good lighting and composition, however it looks soft to me, like the low-light focus could be improved. To make this a nice photo to me, the edges of your triangle must be sharp.', '2005-05-17 17:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392259, 175912, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition and subject matter. This must have been hard to shoot, with that bright light above, causing all else to go dark. however, I like the sepia toning and grain makes this a more artistic piece. I especially like the how the beams create tight little triangles in the bottom center. It would be interesting to see what the original photo looks like.</td>', 'Very interesting composition and subject matter. This must have been hard to shoot, with that bright light above, causing all else to go dark. however, I like the sepia toning and grain makes this a more artistic piece. I especially like the how the beams create tight little triangles in the bottom center. It would be interesting to see what the original photo looks like.', '2005-05-17 17:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392268, 176092, 3419, '<td valign="top">Photo should be larger to do well here (I know, you''ve probably already received this comment a 100 times). Compositionally, this makes a nice abstract. However, I would prefer more contrast and sharpness. Would be interesting to see this in black and white or color-inverted.</td>', 'Photo should be larger to do well here (I know, you''ve probably already received this comment a 100 times). Compositionally, this makes a nice abstract. However, I would prefer more contrast and sharpness. Would be interesting to see this in black and white or color-inverted.', '2005-05-17 17:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392270, 175705, 3419, '<td valign="top">Oooo - an interesting composition which is lost in the thumnail view. Nice exposure. This photo would make a good stock photo, I think.</td>', 'Oooo - an interesting composition which is lost in the thumnail view. Nice exposure. This photo would make a good stock photo, I think.', '2005-05-17 17:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
