(1392535, 175103, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good color, great composition and well conceived depth of field. Terrific all the way around. Kudos to you for a fantastic capture. One of the best in this challenge and should be in the running for a ribbon.<br/> <br/>The only improvement might be to try and remove the SLIGHT haloing around the right eye, antennae and left leg. With this image that would be very easy to do.</td>', 'Good color, great composition and well conceived depth of field. Terrific all the way around. Kudos to you for a fantastic capture. One of the best in this challenge and should be in the running for a ribbon. The only improvement might be to try and remove the SLIGHT haloing around the right eye, antennae and left leg. With this image that would be very easy to do.', '2005-05-17 19:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392537, 174906, 12578, '<td valign="top">A polarised sky here would be great a severe blue sky contrasting against the Pyramid, never the less a great contender in this challenge, good luck</td>', 'A polarised sky here would be great a severe blue sky contrasting against the Pyramid, never the less a great contender in this challenge, good luck', '2005-05-17 19:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
