(1392546, 176606, 17507, '<td valign="top">could have used some levels/curves adjustment to bring out the rock while darkening the water and foliage, i think.</td>', 'could have used some levels/curves adjustment to bring out the rock while darkening the water and foliage, i think.', '2005-05-17 19:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392551, 175880, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great bit of Busa action :0) Nice blur in the wheels for that sense of movement.</td>', 'Great bit of Busa action :0) Nice blur in the wheels for that sense of movement.', '2005-05-17 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392552, 174729, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely picture, but as I see it the one triangle is not a strong compositional element of the picture; it is more accidental and secondary.</td>', 'lovely picture, but as I see it the one triangle is not a strong compositional element of the picture; it is more accidental and secondary.', '2005-05-17 19:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392553, 174577, 11895, '<td valign="top">The lighting at the end of that white tray (?) is a problem, maybe more contrast would help; otherwise a very pleasing image.  You''ve got me heading for the kitchen.</td>', 'The lighting at the end of that white tray (?) is a problem, maybe more contrast would help; otherwise a very pleasing image.  You''ve got me heading for the kitchen.', '2005-05-17 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392554, 175589, 12578, '<td valign="top">WOW ! Such great colours, maybe a slight bit too centered but bar that I cant suggest anything... Good job, Good luck ;0)</td>', 'WOW ! Such great colours, maybe a slight bit too centered but bar that I cant suggest anything... Good job, Good luck ;0)', '2005-05-17 19:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392558, 176590, 17507, '<td valign="top">great DOF and colors, though the orange rocks in the foreground almost overpower the bridge in the background. selective color editing might have enabled you to bring down the tonal range in the rocks while staying within basic editing - though burning would probably do the job better. (6)</td>', 'great DOF and colors, though the orange rocks in the foreground almost overpower the bridge in the background. selective color editing might have enabled you to bring down the tonal range in the rocks while staying within basic editing - though burning would probably do the job better. (6)', '2005-05-17 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392561, 175363, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great action shot capture and the best "triangle" in the challenge. This should be in the running for a ribbon. Kudos for such a great image.<br/> <br/>For purposes of printing after this basic challenge is over I''d recommend applying a little burning in of the white water to bring out more detail. 10-20% would be about right. It is slightly overexposed. I''d also recommend dodging to the tune of about 10% on the kyaker in the shaded area. I''d further suggest you do that on a 50% greyscale layer rather than directly on the image layer itself. Dodge and burn is much more natural when done that way.</td>', 'Great action shot capture and the best "triangle" in the challenge. This should be in the running for a ribbon. Kudos for such a great image. For purposes of printing after this basic challenge is over I''d recommend applying a little burning in of the white water to bring out more detail. 10-20% would be about right. It is slightly overexposed. I''d also recommend dodging to the tune of about 10% on the kyaker in the shaded area. I''d further suggest you do that on a 50% greyscale layer rather than directly on the image layer itself. Dodge and burn is much more natural when done that way.', '2005-05-17 19:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392563, 176180, 17507, '<td valign="top">I salute your choice of subject matter, which is excellent for this challenge. but why this perspective? I feel like you could have done much more to emphasize the triangles if you were shooting from a different location.</td>', 'I salute your choice of subject matter, which is excellent for this challenge. but why this perspective? I feel like you could have done much more to emphasize the triangles if you were shooting from a different location.', '2005-05-17 19:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392566, 175796, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best images in this challenge and should score very high. It is technically perfect and the DOF is just right.</td>', 'This is one of the best images in this challenge and should score very high. It is technically perfect and the DOF is just right.', '2005-05-17 19:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
