(1392634, 176529, 5792, '<td valign="top">It is always good to try new things and take chances with pictures. There are cases where changes in hue can improve an image and transform it into a work of art. Unfortunately, it did not work in this case. This picture is probably much better in it''s original form. I''d chalk this one up as a learning experience.</td>', 'It is always good to try new things and take chances with pictures. There are cases where changes in hue can improve an image and transform it into a work of art. Unfortunately, it did not work in this case. This picture is probably much better in it''s original form. I''d chalk this one up as a learning experience.', '2005-05-17 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392636, 175182, 24272, '<td valign="top">If only you would have taken advantage of the 640 pixel maximum and cropped tighter on the bird....</td>', 'If only you would have taken advantage of the 640 pixel maximum and cropped tighter on the bird....', '2005-05-17 20:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392637, 176130, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks like the spine of a dinosaur. Bump.</td>', 'Wow, this looks like the spine of a dinosaur. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392638, 175441, 22734, '<td valign="top">A triangle you can almost pick up. rather not. Good capture. Bump.</td>', 'A triangle you can almost pick up. rather not. Good capture. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392639, 176138, 24272, '<td valign="top">nice.  No moire and great exposure.  Excellent job on a technically difficult shot!</td>', 'nice.  No moire and great exposure.  Excellent job on a technically difficult shot!', '2005-05-17 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392644, 175105, 22734, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a 6 because this image is nice. I do not think other voters will treat you so because you are not taking advantage of the size alloted to you. Size is very important in these competitions.</td>', 'I''m giving you a 6 because this image is nice. I do not think other voters will treat you so because you are not taking advantage of the size alloted to you. Size is very important in these competitions.', '2005-05-17 20:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392647, 176311, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool structure with lovely color. Bump.</td>', 'Wow, cool structure with lovely color. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392652, 176456, 22734, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice and effective. Bump.</td>', 'Simple but nice and effective. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392654, 176426, 17507, '<td valign="top">great eye.</td>', 'great eye.', '2005-05-17 20:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392656, 176280, 22734, '<td valign="top">very nice and very pleasing to look at. Bump.</td>', 'very nice and very pleasing to look at. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392657, 174825, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image exhibits a common problem with autofocus cameras. Notice that the background is in sharp focus but the main subject is out of focus. That is because the camera focused on the background instead of the main subject as I am sure you intended. The reason might be because there is a lot of physical space taken up by the background and the camera was fooled into thinking that is what you wanted to have in focus.<br/> <br/>This problem can be minimized if you make sure there is a lot of distance between the background and the main subject. In this case you could have done that by taking the picture from table level instead of this angle.</td>', 'This image exhibits a common problem with autofocus cameras. Notice that the background is in sharp focus but the main subject is out of focus. That is because the camera focused on the background instead of the main subject as I am sure you intended. The reason might be because there is a lot of physical space taken up by the background and the camera was fooled into thinking that is what you wanted to have in focus. This problem can be minimized if you make sure there is a lot of distance between the background and the main subject. In this case you could have done that by taking the picture from table level instead of this angle.', '2005-05-17 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392658, 176482, 24272, '<td valign="top">What a neat find!  Meets the definition of the challenge to a T.  The shot doesn''t do much for me, but I''m not counting that against your score ;)</td>', 'What a neat find!  Meets the definition of the challenge to a T.  The shot doesn''t do much for me, but I''m not counting that against your score ;)', '2005-05-17 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392661, 176090, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very cool indeed; doesn''t look anything like a street scene - my impression was of a body of water. Nice lighting. The triangle formed by the hose adds interest too.</td>', 'Very cool indeed; doesn''t look anything like a street scene - my impression was of a body of water. Nice lighting. The triangle formed by the hose adds interest too.', '2005-05-17 20:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392662, 174945, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp and clear with a lovely sky to boot. Bump.</td>', 'Nice sharp and clear with a lovely sky to boot. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392667, 175257, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice action shot. Bump.</td>', 'Very nice action shot. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392671, 174729, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great shot with a suggested triangle. Great time. Bump.</td>', 'A great shot with a suggested triangle. Great time. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392674, 175144, 22734, '<td valign="top">Too rich but very appealing. Bump.</td>', 'Too rich but very appealing. Bump.', '2005-05-17 20:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392676, 175889, 37269, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, that''s really funny.</td>', 'Ha, ha, that''s really funny.', '2005-05-17 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392683, 174729, 37269, '<td valign="top">Really like the colours in the sky, and thebirds draw you in.</td>', 'Really like the colours in the sky, and thebirds draw you in.', '2005-05-17 20:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392684, 176526, 31648, '<td valign="top">nature''s triangles</td>', 'nature''s triangles', '2005-05-17 20:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392686, 175414, 31648, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2005-05-17 20:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392687, 175887, 5792, '<td valign="top">Though it is not a hard and fast rule but if you are creating a natural framing in a picture as you have here that should be in clear focus. Your framing with the tree branches does not work very well. A good example of this type of framing is "Secret Garden" which is  the blue ribbon winner in the outside looking in challenge.</td>', 'Though it is not a hard and fast rule but if you are creating a natural framing in a picture as you have here that should be in clear focus. Your framing with the tree branches does not work very well. A good example of this type of framing is "Secret Garden" which is  the blue ribbon winner in the outside looking in challenge.', '2005-05-17 20:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392701, 174563, 12962, '<td valign="top">Well seen!   I think this is the top among the flower triangles.</td>', 'Well seen!   I think this is the top among the flower triangles.', '2005-05-17 20:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392703, 176092, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent concept. However, the overall low technical quality of the image hurts it more than anything else. Focus is very soft and the colors seem dull. The deep blue spot near the center is a distraction.<br/> <br/>There are several things you might try to make this better. One is to take the original picture with the largest f/stop you can. Even if you have to use a tripod it is worth the effort. This will help have better focus. Next, I would work with colors in post for both brighter better colors and more contrast to give the image more visual impact.<br/> <br/>Artistically speaking there are two things you might try. One would be to frame or crop the image such that both lower tower legs end exact on each corner. This will level your center triangle better and be better balanced. Another artistic thing you might try is instead of centering tower in the middle of the frame you frame the top of the tower at any of the rule of thirds intersection points. That would give the image a more interesting perspective.</td>', 'This is an excellent concept. However, the overall low technical quality of the image hurts it more than anything else. Focus is very soft and the colors seem dull. The deep blue spot near the center is a distraction. There are several things you might try to make this better. One is to take the original picture with the largest f/stop you can. Even if you have to use a tripod it is worth the effort. This will help have better focus. Next, I would work with colors in post for both brighter better colors and more contrast to give the image more visual impact. Artistically speaking there are two things you might try. One would be to frame or crop the image such that both lower tower legs end exact on each corner. This will level your center triangle better and be better balanced. Another artistic thing you might try is instead of centering tower in the middle of the frame you frame the top of the tower at any of the rule of thirds intersection points. That would give the image a more interesting perspective.', '2005-05-17 20:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392706, 175007, 12962, '<td valign="top">Lots of triangles in the rocks too ... and even a face on the top rock!  Reminds me of Joshua tree.  Colors are great, btw.</td>', 'Lots of triangles in the rocks too ... and even a face on the top rock!  Reminds me of Joshua tree.  Colors are great, btw.', '2005-05-17 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392728, 176002, 37885, '<td valign="top">Some dramatic side-lighting would improve this. Also might look better in black-and-white. But it''s a good honest interpretation, and quite appealing.</td>', 'Some dramatic side-lighting would improve this. Also might look better in black-and-white. But it''s a good honest interpretation, and quite appealing.', '2005-05-17 20:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
