(1392759, 174622, 1570, '<td valign="top">i was just commenting on the previous submission, that it''s interesting, how some of the architectural shots in this challenge work, and some just don''t... that one worked for me, and so does this one, too, very, very well, good capture of a very unusual structure... 8.</td>', 'i was just commenting on the previous submission, that it''s interesting, how some of the architectural shots in this challenge work, and some just don''t... that one worked for me, and so does this one, too, very, very well, good capture of a very unusual structure... 8.', '2005-05-17 21:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
