(1392787, 176237, 37885, '<td valign="top">Lovely - like those ''earth from the air'' pictures, but I''m guessing this isn''t taken from very far above the ground. I''d warm up the colour a bit, to get the outer rock neutral and the pool brighter, but that''s personal preference. It works this way too.</td>', 'Lovely - like those ''earth from the air'' pictures, but I''m guessing this isn''t taken from very far above the ground. I''d warm up the colour a bit, to get the outer rock neutral and the pool brighter, but that''s personal preference. It works this way too.', '2005-05-17 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392791, 175748, 37885, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment. Brilliant idea.</td>', 'Took me a moment. Brilliant idea.', '2005-05-17 21:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
