(1392941, 176118, 34904, '<td valign="top">It''s a so-so snapshot.  I like the tri-agle afgan, rug or what ever the cloth on the floor is.  The dog is out of focus, and the focal point doesn''t jump out at the viewer.  I gave it a 3.</td>', 'It''s a so-so snapshot.  I like the tri-agle afgan, rug or what ever the cloth on the floor is.  The dog is out of focus, and the focal point doesn''t jump out at the viewer.  I gave it a 3.', '2005-05-17 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392942, 176055, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, this is a wonderful composition but camera technique has robbed your merits here a bit. Well exposed and focused, this image could have scored in the top 5. You get my 6 for the wonderful composotional strength.</td>', 'Now, this is a wonderful composition but camera technique has robbed your merits here a bit. Well exposed and focused, this image could have scored in the top 5. You get my 6 for the wonderful composotional strength.', '2005-05-17 22:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
