(1393319, 174938, 93, '<td valign="top">First of all.. I''d like to thank everyone that liked this photo and scored it well, and commented nicely.  You guys rock.<br/> <br/>Second of all..  WTF!??!  Obviously I got hit by the blind voters that couldn''t see a triangle here.. FOURTY EIGHT FOURS!??!!?  The triangle is right in front of your face!!!  Twenty-Five threes.. OMFG.<br/> <br/>I don''t rant often.. at least not publically.. but this is absolutely ridiculous.  There were shots that scored much higher than mine that even had less of a triangle in them.  Stupid flower shots.<br/>I''m never entering a flower shot again :)</td>', 'First of all.. I''d like to thank everyone that liked this photo and scored it well, and commented nicely.  You guys rock. Second of all..  WTF!??!  Obviously I got hit by the blind voters that couldn''t see a triangle here.. FOURTY EIGHT FOURS!??!!?  The triangle is right in front of your face!!!  Twenty-Five threes.. OMFG. I don''t rant often.. at least not publically.. but this is absolutely ridiculous.  There were shots that scored much higher than mine that even had less of a triangle in them.  Stupid flower shots.I''m never entering a flower shot again :)', '2005-05-18 01:04:50.000000', NULL, 0),
