(1393596, 176594, 33994, '<td valign="top">All our condolences im sure!  Your comment of not wanting a sympathy vote is unneeded, you did brilliantly, and conveyed true emotion. <br/>The comments reflect your achievement and i hope they help you and your family in some small way.  <br/>Please go back and read them all again, its amazing how well you came across with "just" an image, every comment IMO has a connection, i hope you feel it too. <br/>My little miracle will cirtanly get your hug and kiss.  Im glad to get a reminder once in a while, thanx.<br/> <br/>Sincerely<br/>Rossco</td>', 'All our condolences im sure!  Your comment of not wanting a sympathy vote is unneeded, you did brilliantly, and conveyed true emotion. The comments reflect your achievement and i hope they help you and your family in some small way.  Please go back and read them all again, its amazing how well you came across with "just" an image, every comment IMO has a connection, i hope you feel it too. My little miracle will cirtanly get your hug and kiss.  Im glad to get a reminder once in a while, thanx. SincerelyRossco', '2005-05-18 01:59:13.000000', NULL, 0),
