(1394078, 176486, 4285, '<td valign="top">WTG Neil. Glad to see you finally ribboned (many more to come). Very well deserved. I added it to my favorites.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/> <br/>Owen</td>', 'WTG Neil. Glad to see you finally ribboned (many more to come). Very well deserved. I added it to my favorites. Cheers, Owen', '2005-05-18 07:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394081, 176486, 14603, '<td valign="top">Couldn`t quite believe that this was your first ribbon Neil.<br/>You certainly nailed it with this one..great shot.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Couldn`t quite believe that this was your first ribbon Neil.You certainly nailed it with this one..great shot.Congratulations.', '2005-05-18 07:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394086, 176452, 14603, '<td valign="top">I thought I had seen all there was to see with the "Bird head shots" but this breaks new ground...unbelievably detailed.<br/>Great work and a worthy blue.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'I thought I had seen all there was to see with the "Bird head shots" but this breaks new ground...unbelievably detailed.Great work and a worthy blue.Congratulations.', '2005-05-18 07:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394103, 176409, 31282, '<td valign="top">Yes there is a white ball in the left corner,not enough visible I know...Your monitor must be a little too dark.Thank you for the helpful comments.</td>', 'Yes there is a white ball in the left corner,not enough visible I know...Your monitor must be a little too dark.Thank you for the helpful comments.', '2005-05-18 07:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394105, 175103, 3419, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an amazing macro shot. Well done, and congratulations!</td>', 'Wow, this is an amazing macro shot. Well done, and congratulations!', '2005-05-18 07:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394135, 175186, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fotoshootme:</b></div><hr/><i> how did you do these effects on a basic challenge?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Simple - converted to b&amp;w adjusted in curves, applied usm, thats it.<br/> <br/>Yeh - not a complete triangle but to have included the edge would have also included something that would have distracted the viewer and spoilt the photo.<br/> <br/>Thanks to you all for your time in commenting, they very much appreciated.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-18 07:17:18.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by fotoshootme: how did you do these effects on a basic challenge??   Simple - converted to b&w adjusted in curves, applied usm, thats it. Yeh - not a complete triangle but to have included the edge would have also included something that would have distracted the viewer and spoilt the photo. Thanks to you all for your time in commenting, they very much appreciated. Mike', '2005-05-18 08:15:40.000000', '2005-05-18 08:17:18.000000', 0),
(1394136, 176306, 35253, '<td valign="top">Hi:  I didn''t comment when I voted, but the clarity and smiplicity of this shot got my attention.  It''s nice to be able to sit back and enjoy the work and thought that you put into this.</td>', 'Hi:  I didn''t comment when I voted, but the clarity and smiplicity of this shot got my attention.  It''s nice to be able to sit back and enjoy the work and thought that you put into this.', '2005-05-18 08:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
