(1394269, 176456, 24715, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the comments. I am happy with the score since I almost unsubmitted this photo from the challenge not expecting it to do so well.</td>', 'Thank you for the comments. I am happy with the score since I almost unsubmitted this photo from the challenge not expecting it to do so well.', '2005-05-18 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394271, 175209, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast (and a perfect white background).  The dark spots on the rock hurt this a bit.  Perhaps with a different approach, if possible: a dark background and light shining through the crystal--making it sort of glow--you may have made your prediction!  Hmm, now that I think about it, isn''t that the cover of Pink Floyd''s "The dark side of the moon"?  I''d love to see you post any other attempts.<br/> <br/>BTW -- thanks for giving your special sense of humor to DPC!</td>', 'Excellent contrast (and a perfect white background).  The dark spots on the rock hurt this a bit.  Perhaps with a different approach, if possible: a dark background and light shining through the crystal--making it sort of glow--you may have made your prediction!  Hmm, now that I think about it, isn''t that the cover of Pink Floyd''s "The dark side of the moon"?  I''d love to see you post any other attempts. BTW -- thanks for giving your special sense of humor to DPC!', '2005-05-18 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394279, 175448, 35161, '<td valign="top">Many, many thanks to all of you for commenting and for the kind words! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-18 08:28:39.</i></td>', 'Many, many thanks to all of you for commenting and for the kind words! :)', '2005-05-18 09:28:19.000000', '2005-05-18 09:28:39.000000', 0),
(1394281, 175448, 36499, '<td valign="top">I was hopeing to see u with a ribbon but the top 15 isnt anything to sneeze at. CONGRATS on the finish. Im glad others took the time to actually see the vision and beauty here..excellent work!</td>', 'I was hopeing to see u with a ribbon but the top 15 isnt anything to sneeze at. CONGRATS on the finish. Im glad others took the time to actually see the vision and beauty here..excellent work!', '2005-05-18 09:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394287, 175611, 27246, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on what I thought was a great photo. The deep green shows up beautifully on my monitor, and yet others have claimed my monitor must not be properly calibrated because I felt their pictures were too dark. hmmm...<br/> <br/>I apologize for confusing snooker and billiards, but in reality I was simply giving you kudos for having the best of a dozen or so photos that used a similar theme... most having used billiards balls lined up for the break.</td>', 'Congratulations on what I thought was a great photo. The deep green shows up beautifully on my monitor, and yet others have claimed my monitor must not be properly calibrated because I felt their pictures were too dark. hmmm... I apologize for confusing snooker and billiards, but in reality I was simply giving you kudos for having the best of a dozen or so photos that used a similar theme... most having used billiards balls lined up for the break.', '2005-05-18 09:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
