(1394331, 175440, 14614, '<td valign="top">WOW!  I''m so happy that others like this abstract.  Getting a "my vote to win" and a favortie from Ron is doubly fun.  Thanks to all who voted and especailly to the commenters :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-18 09:00:12.</i></td>', 'WOW!  I''m so happy that others like this abstract.  Getting a "my vote to win" and a favortie from Ron is doubly fun.  Thanks to all who voted and especailly to the commenters :)', '2005-05-18 09:58:40.000000', '2005-05-18 10:00:12.000000', 0),
(1394333, 176306, 32196, '<td valign="top">thanks everybody for voting and commenting on this picture:) my personal record so far. most of the comments praised it as  being "creative" or "unexpected". well, i was racking my brain trying to think of a triangle, when it was just under my nose :) i was lucky to notice it, which was quite unexpected:). and yes, i wear those colours myself. in public! (since somebody here hoped i didn''t).</td>', 'thanks everybody for voting and commenting on this picture:) my personal record so far. most of the comments praised it as  being "creative" or "unexpected". well, i was racking my brain trying to think of a triangle, when it was just under my nose :) i was lucky to notice it, which was quite unexpected:). and yes, i wear those colours myself. in public! (since somebody here hoped i didn''t).', '2005-05-18 09:59:12.000000', NULL, 0),
