(1394735, 174214, 33672, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. Not happy with the results but I think I got what it deserved. I wanted more contrast but the ground was too dry and the care takers wouldn''t let water them. I left the trestles in the background to show what the place was. Maybe it ws a bad choice. Still turned out better than my average.  I can be content...</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. Not happy with the results but I think I got what it deserved. I wanted more contrast but the ground was too dry and the care takers wouldn''t let water them. I left the trestles in the background to show what the place was. Maybe it ws a bad choice. Still turned out better than my average.  I can be content...', '2005-05-18 12:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
