(1394740, 175589, 36355, '<td valign="top">This was the only image I rated a 9, and the highest rating I gave.  Although one commenter said it was "not even all THAT triangular", I clearly note the inverted triangle from tip of black tail feathers to wingtips-across forewings-back to black tail feathers. Really nice rich colors. Worthy of a blue, in my mind, but the falcon shot was pretty sharp too. Congrats on a 4th.</td>', 'This was the only image I rated a 9, and the highest rating I gave.  Although one commenter said it was "not even all THAT triangular", I clearly note the inverted triangle from tip of black tail feathers to wingtips-across forewings-back to black tail feathers. Really nice rich colors. Worthy of a blue, in my mind, but the falcon shot was pretty sharp too. Congrats on a 4th.', '2005-05-18 12:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
