(1394835, 175939, 33672, '<td valign="top">Suri, Estoy muy orgulloso de ti y tus resultas con este photo. (tal vez un poco celoso tambien) Espero que esto te dice que tienes el ojo para esto. (algo que me falta) y con practica y fuerzas puedas lograr mucho exito.  Como te digo siempre...Abilidad sin disciplin no se sierve. Y siempre tengo razon..  ;)</td>', 'Suri, Estoy muy orgulloso de ti y tus resultas con este photo. (tal vez un poco celoso tambien) Espero que esto te dice que tienes el ojo para esto. (algo que me falta) y con practica y fuerzas puedas lograr mucho exito.  Como te digo siempre...Abilidad sin disciplin no se sierve. Y siempre tengo razon..  ;)', '2005-05-18 12:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1394947, 176430, 36583, '<td valign="top">Well, I certainly didn''t think this shot would win, but I also didn''t expect it to be beaten quite handily by a bowl of nacho chips... Oh well. The tree in the puddle actually is in focus, but the wind was blowing, which created the ripples in the water; Also, I was going for the DOF thing... I thought it was cool that the ground and the reflection were on the same plane but differentially focused. Obviously I liked this better than most of the raters :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-18 12:00:11.</i></td>', 'Well, I certainly didn''t think this shot would win, but I also didn''t expect it to be beaten quite handily by a bowl of nacho chips... Oh well. The tree in the puddle actually is in focus, but the wind was blowing, which created the ripples in the water; Also, I was going for the DOF thing... I thought it was cool that the ground and the reflection were on the same plane but differentially focused. Obviously I liked this better than most of the raters :)', '2005-05-18 12:59:35.000000', '2005-05-18 13:00:11.000000', 0),
