(1399142, 174938, 23680, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to comment during voting but gave you a 9.  I saw the triangle right away, but it was the colors that jumped out at me.  My only 2 small complaints were the little tiny part of the other flowers in the lower right hand corner and the dark red in the background.  I know those are small things, but all in all I really loved this shot, yes, I admit it, I am a flower lover :)</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to comment during voting but gave you a 9.  I saw the triangle right away, but it was the colors that jumped out at me.  My only 2 small complaints were the little tiny part of the other flowers in the lower right hand corner and the dark red in the background.  I know those are small things, but all in all I really loved this shot, yes, I admit it, I am a flower lover :)', '2005-05-19 19:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1399369, 174938, 5705, '<td valign="top">Don''t stop shooting flowers, It''s a beautifull photograph.<br/>This challenge yielded some strange voting, more so than usuall.<br/>Be proud of a very nice shot.<br/>I do agree w/Tuckersmomom about the little part of the other flower showing in the bottom right part of the shot, coulda been easily cropped out.</td>', 'Don''t stop shooting flowers, It''s a beautifull photograph.This challenge yielded some strange voting, more so than usuall.Be proud of a very nice shot.I do agree w/Tuckersmomom about the little part of the other flower showing in the bottom right part of the shot, coulda been easily cropped out.', '2005-05-19 21:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1399440, 174938, 10080, '<td valign="top">Definately a nice shot. I like the colors and the use of d.o.f. This should have averaged MUCH better than it did! It just seems like lately, even on the best work, people are shelling out 1''s and 2''s to shots that are way in the 7 and 8 range? I would have given it an 8.</td>', 'Definately a nice shot. I like the colors and the use of d.o.f. This should have averaged MUCH better than it did! It just seems like lately, even on the best work, people are shelling out 1''s and 2''s to shots that are way in the 7 and 8 range? I would have given it an 8.', '2005-05-19 21:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1400031, 175589, 36487, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot smali, the colours are just perfect and the clarity is spot on. Congrats on your 4th spot, I think it was worthy of a ribbon myself, and only your second entry! You have set yourself a high standard, I just hope you can keep it going - looking forward to more of your work.</td>', 'Awesome shot smali, the colours are just perfect and the clarity is spot on. Congrats on your 4th spot, I think it was worthy of a ribbon myself, and only your second entry! You have set yourself a high standard, I just hope you can keep it going - looking forward to more of your work.', '2005-05-20 05:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
