(1551349, 176452, 23535, '<td valign="top">u r luck that he didnt eat u.. :P<br/></td>', 'u r luck that he didnt eat u.. :P', '2005-07-20 20:23:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1556841, 176258, 32767, '<td valign="top">Self imposed DQ for the record. I didn''t realize it was an Open Challenge and had done some light dodging and burning and reported myself to the SC. That''s why there''s a note at the end of the details that states, "Thanks for your honesty".</td>', 'Self imposed DQ for the record. I didn''t realize it was an Open Challenge and had done some light dodging and burning and reported myself to the SC. That''s why there''s a note at the end of the details that states, "Thanks for your honesty".', '2005-07-23 10:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1558081, 175445, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is a much improved shot over the previous image. The water is a little too overwhelming and I wished there was more blue sky than there is dark green water. This would be a great building to capture at night. Ever thought of that?</td>', 'This is a much improved shot over the previous image. The water is a little too overwhelming and I wished there was more blue sky than there is dark green water. This would be a great building to capture at night. Ever thought of that?', '2005-07-24 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1558087, 175445, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rikki11:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a much improved shot over the previous image. The water is a little too overwhelming and I wished there was more blue sky than there is dark green water. This would be a great building to capture at night. Ever thought of that? </i></td></tr></table><i></i> I would love to capture this at night but have not had the opportunity, I work near this building and often walk here during my lunch hour.  Thank you so much for all your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by rikki11: This is a much improved shot over the previous image. The water is a little too overwhelming and I wished there was more blue sky than there is dark green water. This would be a great building to capture at night. Ever thought of that?  I would love to capture this at night but have not had the opportunity, I work near this building and often walk here during my lunch hour.  Thank you so much for all your comments.', '2005-07-24 00:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1580858, 176730, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very well done!<br/> <br/>I really like the facial expression of the model it makes me automtically grin when I view it.<br/> <br/>The composition, contrast, tones and softness are all very well done. Is it a shame that more time can not be given to the voting process.</td>', 'Very well done! I really like the facial expression of the model it makes me automtically grin when I view it. The composition, contrast, tones and softness are all very well done. Is it a shame that more time can not be given to the voting process.', '2005-08-02 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 0),
