(1607245, 176288, 37520, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paintintheneck:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks creative and I like the color </i></td></tr></table> <br/>thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by paintintheneck: Looks creative and I like the color  thank you.', '2005-08-13 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1607248, 176288, 37520, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lsheppard:</b></div><hr/><i> Good concept, but I think the photo would be improved with more dramatic lighting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>YES!  I agree</td>', 'Originally posted by lsheppard: Good concept, but I think the photo would be improved with more dramatic lighting.   YES!  I agree', '2005-08-13 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650180, 176245, 38267, '<td valign="top">Good idea with this shot.  I agree with some of the others that the exposure and color seems to be off...a little too washed out.</td>', 'Good idea with this shot.  I agree with some of the others that the exposure and color seems to be off...a little too washed out.', '2005-08-27 17:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1693956, 174194, 37719, '<td valign="top">I wonder why this didn''t do better in the challenge.  It is a good pic and quite creative besides.  Good eye!</td>', 'I wonder why this didn''t do better in the challenge.  It is a good pic and quite creative besides.  Good eye!', '2005-09-10 23:50:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1714047, 175170, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the blur is intentional or not, but it doesn''t "feel" like it IMHO.  I think that if you were to apply say a watercolor filter to this shot, you could capitalize on the blurriness though.  You''ve got nice tonal range and I like the composition.</td>', 'Not sure if the blur is intentional or not, but it doesn''t "feel" like it IMHO.  I think that if you were to apply say a watercolor filter to this shot, you could capitalize on the blurriness though.  You''ve got nice tonal range and I like the composition.', '2005-09-16 12:37:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1714922, 175170, 24981, '<td valign="top">The blur was unintentional. Shooting at dusk hand-held was the problem.</td>', 'The blur was unintentional. Shooting at dusk hand-held was the problem.', '2005-09-16 19:45:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1725406, 176479, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice setup and concept. if the cards were a little brighter and stood out more, you may have had a much better score. <br/></td>', 'nice setup and concept. if the cards were a little brighter and stood out more, you may have had a much better score. ', '2005-09-20 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1743299, 175991, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good triangle entry.  The colors just pop and dance in this one.  The triangles themselves are very strong and have that cool metallic look!</td>', 'Very good triangle entry.  The colors just pop and dance in this one.  The triangles themselves are very strong and have that cool metallic look!', '2005-09-27 21:03:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1834176, 176452, 26733, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s a great shot.</td>', 'Wow! That''s a great shot.', '2005-11-02 18:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1992612, 176479, 34659, '<td valign="top">ROFL @ your photographer''s comments!  While I like the idea of this shot, I think it lost some of its impact in the execution and presentation.  The image is too dark and the angle doesn''t allow the viewer to see the cards'' faces very well.  Also, a different color background might have brightened it up a bit.  Again, not trying to be a wet blanket, because it was a great idea and it''s not a bad shot, I just think it could have been better (especially after seeing some of your other images and how well you work with lighting and color).</td>', 'ROFL @ your photographer''s comments!  While I like the idea of this shot, I think it lost some of its impact in the execution and presentation.  The image is too dark and the angle doesn''t allow the viewer to see the cards'' faces very well.  Also, a different color background might have brightened it up a bit.  Again, not trying to be a wet blanket, because it was a great idea and it''s not a bad shot, I just think it could have been better (especially after seeing some of your other images and how well you work with lighting and color).', '2006-01-01 15:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2015741, 175448, 43671, '<td valign="top">you are amazing with you photos and the way you post process them.</td>', 'you are amazing with you photos and the way you post process them.', '2006-01-08 19:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2360411, 176503, 47117, '<td valign="top">Again, the blue on the black works very well here. Nice work!</td>', 'Again, the blue on the black works very well here. Nice work!', '2006-04-30 00:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2439677, 174560, 36470, '<td valign="top">Love this black and white.  I agree that you have turned something simple and uninteresting into a work of art that is pleasing to look at.</td>', 'Love this black and white.  I agree that you have turned something simple and uninteresting into a work of art that is pleasing to look at.', '2006-05-20 08:37:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2462035, 176055, 34659, '<td valign="top">I''m sure nothing you haven''t already heard before about the technical aspects of this shot (focus, exposure, etc.) - BUT, the composition is really outstanding.  Can''t believe you got them all to pose long enough to get a shot off.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m sure nothing you haven''t already heard before about the technical aspects of this shot (focus, exposure, etc.) - BUT, the composition is really outstanding.  Can''t believe you got them all to pose long enough to get a shot off.  Well done.', '2006-05-27 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2492106, 176486, 42567, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!  Congratulations on your 2nd place!</td>', 'This is amazing!  Congratulations on your 2nd place!', '2006-06-07 00:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2513940, 174945, 58785, '<td valign="top">I like this... Very cool, simple yet powerful :)</td>', 'I like this... Very cool, simple yet powerful :)', '2006-06-13 21:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2586298, 174560, 17148, '<td valign="top">Great lines herelove the geometry to thisI like the bucket sitting there at a tiltgreat B&amp;W alsowonderfully simple image.</td>', 'Great lines herelove the geometry to thisI like the bucket sitting there at a tiltgreat B&W alsowonderfully simple image.', '2006-07-05 02:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
